Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,《指环王》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不能过来！ - 甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You cannot pass! - Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我是圣火的仆人，高举着亚尔诺炽焰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a servant of the Secret Fire, wielder of the flame of Anor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,滚回黑暗中吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to the Shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗之火不会帮你的，乌顿之火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dark fire will not avail you, flame of Udun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能过来！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shall not pass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不！别去！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.08,0:02:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你们快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly, you fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多，怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是做了梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.12,0:04:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,《双塔奇兵》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你看得到底吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you see the bottom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看不到，别往下看，山姆，继续爬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Don't look down, Sam! Just keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,接住！佛罗多，快接住！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch it! Grab it, Mr. Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我爬到底了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I've found the bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,沼泽和绳子，天晓得还有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bogs and rope, and goodness knows what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,情况太糟糕了，糟糕透顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not natural. None of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这装了什么？ - 没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's in this? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.68,0:05:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一点调味料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a bit of seasoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想不好哪天晚餐有烤鸡吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought maybe if we was having a roast chicken one night or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,烤鸡？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roast chicken?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谁晓得呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆，你真是够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam. My dear Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这很特别耶，这是夏尔最好的盐巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very special, that. It's the best salt in all the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这才有家乡的味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a little bit of home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不能把绳子留在这儿，让别人跟着我们下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't leave this here for someone to follow us down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会跟我们跟到这儿，佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna follow us down here, Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好可惜哦，这是凯兰崔尔女王送我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame, really. Lady Galadriel gave me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的精灵绳子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real Elvish rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么拉也没有用，我绑得很紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's nothing for it. It's one of my knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,扯不下来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't come free in a hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的精灵绳子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real Elvish rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,魔多，那是在中土世界，我们最不想去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mordor. The one place in Middle-earth we don't want to see any closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们却非去不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's the one place we're trying to get to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,只是我们又一直走不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just where we can't get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,面对现实吧，我们迷路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's face it, Mr. Frodo, we're lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫不会希望我们走这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think Gandalf meant for us to come this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他不希望发生很多事，山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't mean for a lot of things to happen, Sam...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但是却发生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but they did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是那只魔戒，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Ring, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,它变得越来越重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting heavier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还剩什么吃的？ - 我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What food have we got left? - Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有了，棒呆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. Lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,兰巴斯干粮，你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lembas bread. And look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,更多兰巴斯干粮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More lembas bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我通常不太爱吃怪东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't usually hold with foreign food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这种精灵干粮真的不错吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but this Elvish stuff, it's not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都不能影响你的心情，对吧，山姆？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing ever dampens your spirits, does it, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那些乌云就能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those rain clouds might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方好眼熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This looks strangely familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为我们来过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's because we've been here before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在兜圈子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going in circles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什么味道那么臭？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that horrid stink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌附近一定有沼泽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warrant there's a nasty bog nearby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你闻得到吗？ - 闻得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you smell it? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我闻到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can smell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿有别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,小偷，那些小偷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thieves. The thieves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那些臭小偷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The filthy little thieves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从我们身上把它偷走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They stole it from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们诅咒他们，我们恨他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curse them, we hates them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,它是我们的，我们想要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's ours, it is, and we wants it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是针刺宝剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Sting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前也看过它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen it before...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧，咕鲁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}haven't you, Gollum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他，否则我就割断你的喉咙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release him or I'll cut your throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好烫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It burns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,烫死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It burns us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,冰死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It freezes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,臭精灵打造的绳子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nasty Elves twisted it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快帮我们解开 - 给我闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take it off us! - Quiet, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不行，魔多的半兽人会听到他鬼叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hopeless. Every Orc in Mordor's going to hear this racket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把他绑起来留在这儿吧 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's just tie him up and leave him. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们一定会死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would kill us! Kill us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你死了是活该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no more than you deserve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他的确是该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he does deserve to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我看到他倒是很可怜他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now that I see him, I do pity him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们只要对我们好，我们就一定会报答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We be nice to them if they be nice to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快把绳子解开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it off us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发誓一定会乖乖听话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We swears to do what you wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对天发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We swears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不相信你发的誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no promise you can make that I can trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.48,0:12:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We swears...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会服侍宝贝的主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to serve the master of the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们愿意对…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will swear on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.36,0:12:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,…宝贝发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,咕鲁，咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gollum. Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒力量强大不可靠，我们会逼你信守承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring is treacherous. It will hold you to your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对宝贝发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对宝贝发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 下来，快下来 - 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get down! I said, down! - Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要骗我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to trick us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们放了他，他一定会趁我们熟睡偷袭我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we let him go, he'll throttle us in our sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道去魔多的路吗？ - 知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know the way to Mordor? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你去过那儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been there before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,去过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你要带领我们到黑门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will lead us to the Black Gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.72,0:13:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊，去黑门，去黑门，主人说去就去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the Gate, to the Gate! To the Gate, the master says. Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我们不能回去，不能回去他那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! We won't go back. Not there. Not to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不能逼我们，咕鲁，咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't make us. Gollum! Gollum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我们发誓要服侍宝贝的主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we swore to serve the master of the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，那儿只有灰烬和沙尘，还有无止无尽的坑洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Ashes and dust and thirst there is, and pits, pits, pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还有成千上万个半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Orcses, thousands of Orcses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,而且邪眼日夜不休地看着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And always the Great Eye watching, watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,回来，给我回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Come back now! Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧，我就说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There! What did I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那小坏蛋落跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's run off, the old villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他发誓也没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much for his promises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿，哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Hobbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:14:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你太慢了，主人就快失去耐心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late. Our master grows impatient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在就要那些夏尔的小家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants the Shire-rats now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不听臭半兽人的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't take orders from Orc-maggots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼会得到他的大礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman will have his prize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会把他们交给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will deliver them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.96,0:15:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry? Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友生病了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend is sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要水，求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs water. Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他生病了？那就给他吃药吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sick, is he? Give him some medicine, boys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是良药苦口呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't take his draught!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快住手 - 怎么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leave him alone! - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你也想喝吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want some?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那就乖乖闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then keep your mouth shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Pip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你受伤了 - 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're hurt. - I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是故意装的 - 装的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was just an act. - An act?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧，连你也被我骗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? I fooled you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别替我担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about me, Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？你闯到什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? What do you smell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man-flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们追上来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've picked up our trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们加快了脚步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their pace has quickened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一定闯到我们的气味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have caught our scent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.76,0:17:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快呀，金灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Gimli!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们追了三天三夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days and nights pursuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没吃饭、没休息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No food. No rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没有敌人的踪迹，只有光秃秃的乱石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no sign of our quarry, but what bare rock can tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,罗端安别针不会无故掉下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not idly do the leaves of Lorien fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They may yet be alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们离我们不到一天脚程，来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Less than a day ahead of us. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，就快追上他们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Gimli! We're gaining on them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,长途跋涉我最不在行，咱们矮人是天生短跑健将{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm wasted on cross-country. We Dwarves are natural sprinters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,短距离内爆发力十足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very dangerous over short distances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,骠骑之乡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home of the Horse-lords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,事情有蹊跷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something strange at work here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们这么拚命赶路一定有原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some evil gives speed to these creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想对付我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sets its will against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,勒苟拉斯，你的精灵眼睛看到什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas! What do your Elf-eyes see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,强兽人转往东北方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Uruks turn northeast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.64,0:19:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要把哈比人带到艾辛格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are taking the Hobbits to Isengard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,世局改变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world is changing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在谁有力量抵档艾辛格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who now has the strength to stand against the armies of Isengard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和魔多大军的攻势？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Mordor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁能对抗索伦和萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To stand against the might of Sauron and Saruman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,以及双城结盟的力量？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the union of the two towers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦魔君，只要我们携手合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, my Lord Sauron...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:20:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就能统治中土世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we shall rule this Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,大自然将被工业之火吞蚀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Old World will burn in the fires of industry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,森林将被夷为平地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The forests will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一股新势力将会崛起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new order will rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将以半兽人的坚甲利兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will drive the machine of war with the sword and the spear...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,发动千军万马的战争机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the iron fists of the Orc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我要大军两星期内就准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want them armed and ready to march within two weeks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可是，主人，他们的人数太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, my lord, there are too many!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法这么快说准备好，我们没有足够的军备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cannot all be armed in time, we don't have the means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.00,0:21:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,筑坝堵住河水，不眠不休打造兵器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Build a dam, block the stream, work the furnaces night and day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有足够的木柴用来生火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have enough fuel to feed the fires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,法贡森林就在我们大门口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Forest of Fangorn lies on our doorstep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把它给烧了 - 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Burn it. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们愿意为你出战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will fight for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对天发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们愿意为萨鲁曼死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will die for Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,骠骑国人民强占你们的土地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Horse-Men took your lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你们被他们赶到深山过着苦哈哈的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They drove your people into the hills to scratch a living off rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,杀人者死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,抢回你们被夺走的每一块土地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take back the lands they stole from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,烧毁每一个村庄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn every village!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须铲除所有的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have only to remove those who oppose us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国是第一个目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will begin in Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这些农夫一直和你作对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too long have these peasants stood against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧参！伊欧参！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eothain! Eothain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,带着你妹妹，只有你们两个骑得会比较快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take your sister. You'll go faster with just two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸说伊欧参不能骑加鲁夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Papa says Eothain must not ride Garulf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.52,0:22:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他太高大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is too big for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.36,0:22:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说，你要骑到伊多拉斯警告他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. You must ride to Edoras and raise the alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.52,0:22:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你明白吗？ - 明白，妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you understand me? - Yes, Mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.32,0:22:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想走，我不要走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to leave. I don't want to go, Mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,斐黛，我会去找你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freda, I will find you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.12,0:22:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧，孩子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.56,0:23:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,魔君，洛汗国…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rohan, my lord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,…即将毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is ready to fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,希优德？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theodred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.68,0:23:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快找到王子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the king's son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.76,0:23:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 魔多会付出代价 - 这些半兽人不是来自魔多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mordor will pay for this. - These Orcs are not from Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧墨，这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Lord Eomer, over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,希优德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theodred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.40,0:24:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,王上，您的儿子受了重伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son is badly wounded, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.88,0:24:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他遭到半兽人埋伏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was ambushed by Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不捍卫国家，就会被萨鲁曼夺走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't defend our country, Saruman will take it by force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.92,0:24:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一派胡言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.60,0:25:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,白袍巫师萨鲁曼一向是我们的盟友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman the White has ever been our friend and ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.08,0:25:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,葛力马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grima.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.56,0:25:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,葛力马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grima.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.00,0:25:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,葛力马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grima.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.32,0:25:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,半兽人在我国横行霸道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orcs are roaming freely across our lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.76,0:25:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,肆无忌惮地杀人放火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unchecked. Unchallenged. Killing at will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.08,0:25:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们身上有萨鲁曼的白掌徽记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orcs bearing the White Hand of Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.80,0:25:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要让心事重重的国王烦上加烦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you lay these troubles on an already troubled mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.76,0:25:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看到吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you not see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.36,0:25:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你叔叔受够了你的恶行恶状{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your uncle is wearied by your malcontent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.64,0:25:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你的好勇善斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your warmongering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.36,0:25:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好勇善斗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warmongering?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼买通了你有多久？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long is it since Saruman bought you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他答应给你什么，葛力马？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was the promised price, Grima?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.12,0:26:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,等人类全死光，你就能瓜分财宝？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When all the Men are dead, you will take your share of the treasure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你早就觊觎我妹妹的美色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too long have you watched my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.04,0:26:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一直偷偷跟踪她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too long have you haunted her steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你管太多了，伊欧墨，伊欧蒙德之子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see much, Eomer, son of Eomund.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.60,0:26:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你管太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.08,0:26:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你将被放逐在洛汗国之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are banished forthwith from the kingdom of Rohan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.08,0:26:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,直到痛苦死去为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all its domains under pain of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.32,0:26:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你算什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no authority here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.80,0:26:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不听你的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your orders mean nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.84,0:26:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This order does not come from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是国王的旨令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It comes from the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.56,0:27:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他今天早上亲手签的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He signed it this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.76,0:27:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸均匀，这就是绝窍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep breathing. That's the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.76,0:27:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸均匀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.52,0:27:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们好像被主人鞭打一样狂奔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've run as if the very whips of their masters were behind them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.56,0:28:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要休息一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going no further...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.76,0:28:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,才能继续走下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until we've had a breather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.28,0:28:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,升起营火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a fire going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.28,0:28:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不该离开夏尔的，皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we might have made a mistake leaving the Shire, Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.96,0:28:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么声音？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's making that noise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.72,0:28:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那是树的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.92,0:28:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.32,0:28:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得雄鹿地边境的老林吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember the Old Forest, on the borders of Buckland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.32,0:28:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说水中有什么东西能让树木长高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Folk used to say there was something in the water that made the trees grow tall...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.96,0:28:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,然后活过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and come alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.76,0:28:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,活过来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.32,0:28:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,树木可以低语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trees that could whisper...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.04,0:29:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,互相交谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}talk to each other...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.64,0:29:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至走动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.16,0:29:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我饿死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.52,0:29:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这三天只能吃长满蛆的面包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't had nothing but maggoty bread for three stinking days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.44,0:29:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么不能吃肉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't we have some meat?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.08,0:29:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们吃掉如何？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.48,0:29:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的肉很新鲜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.00,0:29:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不能吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are not for eating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.76,0:29:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只吃腿呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about their legs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.88,0:29:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,反正他们又用不着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't need those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.68,0:29:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看起来很好吃 - 给我滚回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They look tasty. - Get back, scum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.68,0:29:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这些犯人要交给萨鲁曼，活生生的、毫发无伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prisoners go to Saruman. Alive and unspoiled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.96,0:29:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,活生生的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.88,0:29:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？他要把他们当成猎物吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why alive? Do they give good sport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.56,0:30:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有一样东西，一种精灵的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have something. An Elvish weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.04,0:30:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,主人要用来打仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The master wants it for the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.96,0:30:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以为魔戒在我们身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They think we have the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.00,0:30:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们发现不在我们身上，我们就死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as they find out we don't, we're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.32,0:30:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只吃一小口…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a mouthful...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.44,0:30:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,…又何妨呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a bit of the flank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.44,0:30:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这下咱们就有肉可吃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like meat's back on the menu, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.64,0:30:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.08,0:30:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.16,0:30:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.88,0:30:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,去求救呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,尖叫呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squeal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.08,0:30:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会来救你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's going to save you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.44,0:31:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.16,0:31:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,血红的太阳升起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A red sun rises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.16,0:31:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚一定曾经发生杀戮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood has been spilled this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riders of Rohan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.56,0:32:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,骠骑国有什么消息？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what news from the Mark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.72,0:32:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一个精灵、凡人和矮人为何闯进骠骑国？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What business does an Elf, a Man and a Dwarf have in the Riddermark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.92,0:32:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.56,0:32:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,骑士，你先报上名来，我就说出我的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your name, horse-master, and I shall give you mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.32,0:33:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你长的那么矮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would cut off your head, Dwarf...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.36,0:33:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我就一剑让你的人头落地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it stood but a little higher from the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.72,0:33:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我会先让你一箭毙命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would die before your stroke fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.52,0:33:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我是亚拉冈，亚拉松之子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Aragorn, son of Arathorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.76,0:33:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是金灵，葛罗音之子，精灵勒苟拉斯来自幽暗密林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Gimli, son of Gloin, and Legolas of the Woodland Realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.12,0:33:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是洛汗国以及骠骑王希优顿之友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are friends of Rohan and of Theoden, your king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.08,0:33:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿已经分不出敌友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoden no longer recognizes friend from foe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.08,0:33:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他连自家人都认不得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even his own kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.76,0:33:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼在国王身上下毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman has poisoned the mind of the king...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.92,0:33:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,将这片土地占为己有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and claimed lordship over these lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.80,0:33:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们誓死效忠洛汗国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My company are those loyal to Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.00,0:33:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才会遭到放逐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for that, we are banished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.84,0:33:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,白袍巫师诡计多端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The White Wizard is cunning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.80,0:34:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,听说他身披白色斗蓬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He walks here and there, they say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.36,0:34:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,到处神出鬼没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as an old man hooded and cloaked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.28,0:34:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他的爪牙也逃过我们的监视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And everywhere, his spies slip past our nets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.24,0:34:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是他的爪牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are no spies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.64,0:34:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一路向西，横越平原追赶一群强兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We track a party of Uruk-hai westward across the plain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们抓走我们两个朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have taken two of our friends captive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.00,0:34:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那群强兽人死了，我们昨晚歼灭了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Uruks are destroyed. We slaughtered them during the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.64,0:34:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们抓走两名哈比人，你没看见两个哈比人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there were two Hobbits. Did you see two Hobbits with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.96,0:34:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们身材矮小，跟人类小孩一样高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would be small. Only children to your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.32,0:34:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有留下活口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We left none alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.96,0:34:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把尸体堆起来烧掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We piled the carcasses and burned them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.32,0:34:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,死了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.60,0:34:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.84,0:34:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哈苏风、阿罗德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hasufel! Arod!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.96,0:35:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,希望这两匹马能带给你们好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May these horses bear you to better fortune than their former masters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.88,0:35:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,后会有期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farewell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.68,0:35:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去找你们的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look for your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.36,0:35:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但别心存希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But do not trust to hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.32,0:35:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们早已失去希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has forsaken these lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.08,0:35:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们往北走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ride north!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.72,0:36:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们的小腰带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of their wee belts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.32,0:36:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对不起他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We failed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.40,0:36:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一个哈比人躺在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Hobbit lay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.44,0:36:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.88,0:37:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在地上爬行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They crawled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.64,0:37:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,双手被绑住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their hands were bound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.92,0:37:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们割断绳索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their bonds were cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.16,0:37:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后跑到这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They ran over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.96,0:37:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有人追上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were followed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.36,0:37:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,脱掉腰带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The belt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.04,0:37:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.84,0:37:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的足迹远离战场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracks lead away from the battle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.04,0:38:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,逃进法贡森林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into Fangorn Forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.04,0:38:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,法贡森林？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fangorn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.68,0:38:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,难道他们疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What madness drove them in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.00,0:38:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,甩掉他们了吗？好像甩掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we lose him? I think we lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.72,0:38:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把你们的小心脏给挖出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to rip out your filthy little innards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.40,0:38:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,给我过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.92,0:38:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快，爬到树上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trees. Climb a tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.80,0:39:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.60,0:39:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.40,0:39:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我要在你的肚子上戳一个洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's put a maggot hole in your belly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.92,0:39:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑呀，梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.28,0:40:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,小半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.76,0:40:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他在说话，这探树在说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's talking, Merry. The tree is talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.28,0:40:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,树？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.32,0:40:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am no tree!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.52,0:40:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是树人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am an Ent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.28,0:40:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,牧树者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tree-herder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.00,0:40:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,森林的守护者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A shepherd of the forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.12,0:40:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟他说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to it, Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.00,0:40:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,别鼓励他说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't encourage it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.68,0:40:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人叫我树须{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treebeard, some call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.04,0:40:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你站在哪一边？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whose side are you on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.64,0:40:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一边？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.48,0:40:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不站在哪一边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am on nobody's side...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.68,0:40:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,因为没有人站在我这一边，小半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because nobody's on my side, little Orc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.84,0:40:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人关心这片森林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody cares for the woods anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.84,0:40:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是哈比人，不是半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not Orcs! We're Hobbits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.40,0:40:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哈比人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.96,0:40:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我没听过哈比人这玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never heard of a Hobbit before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:41:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来像是半兽人的幌子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like Orc mischief to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.72,0:41:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拿着火把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They come with fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.08,0:41:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还有斧头闯进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They come with axes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.88,0:41:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,又咬又啃、又砍又烧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gnawing, biting, breaking, hacking, burning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.88,0:41:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 毁灭者、掠夺者，诅咒他们 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Destroyers and usurpers! Curse them! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.88,0:41:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白，我们是哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand. We're Hobbits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.88,0:41:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,半身人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halflings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.88,0:41:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,夏尔人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shire-folk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.20,0:41:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也许是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.80,0:41:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and maybe you aren't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.56,0:41:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,白袍巫师一定知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The White Wizard will know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.24,0:41:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,白袍巫师？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The White Wizard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.76,0:41:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.76,0:41:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧，瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.68,0:41:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把你们带出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've led you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.28,0:41:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快走呀，哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, Hobbitses. Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.84,0:42:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到你们真幸运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very lucky we find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.08,0:42:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.68,0:42:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,沼泽，他把我们带到一片臭沼泽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bog. He's led us into a swamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.12,0:42:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,沼泽，没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A swamp, yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.48,0:42:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，主人，我们带你穿过迷雾走到安全处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, master. We will take you on safe paths through the mist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.56,0:42:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，哈比人，快点走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Hobbits! Come! We go quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.28,0:42:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我发现的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found it. I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.08,0:42:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现穿过沼泽的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way through the marshes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.96,0:42:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,半兽人不知道，也不会走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orcs don't use it. Orcs don't know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.64,0:42:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都烧一大圈走远路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They go around for miles and miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.96,0:42:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.56,0:42:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要像影子一样一闪而过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soft and quick as shadows we must be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.80,0:42:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方不对劲，太安静了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate this place. It's too quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.28,0:43:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,走了两天都没看见或听到一只鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been no sight nor sound of a bird for two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.72,0:43:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没有鸟可以吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no birdses to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.36,0:43:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有好吃的鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No crunchable birdses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.20,0:43:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快饿死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are famished! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.24,0:43:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快饿死了，宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Famished we are, precious!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.48,0:43:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.20,0:43:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it eats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.40,0:43:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好不好吃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it tasty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.72,0:43:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们差点就被呛死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tries to chokes us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.56,0:43:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能吃哈比人食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't eats Hobbit food!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.92,0:43:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定会饿死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must starve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.12,0:43:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,饿死了活该，那最好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, starve, then. And good riddance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.28,0:44:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没良心的哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, cruel Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.72,0:44:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们饿肚子他不管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does not care if we be hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.76,0:44:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们死了他也不管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does not care if we should die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.16,0:44:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他不像主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.36,0:44:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,主人关心我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master cares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.60,0:44:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,主人了解我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.96,0:44:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.08,0:44:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.28,0:44:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,它控制了我们…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once it takes hold of us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.76,0:44:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,…就永远不会放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it never lets go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.64,0:44:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.28,0:45:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,里面有死东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are dead things!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.32,0:45:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,水里有死人的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead faces in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.96,0:45:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都死了，都烂掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All dead. All rotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.44,0:45:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵、人类和半兽人都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elves and Men and Orcses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.40,0:45:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前这儿有一场大战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A great battle long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.80,0:45:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡沼泽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead Marshes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.76,0:45:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，这就是它的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes, that is their name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.16,0:45:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,走这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.12,0:45:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟着鬼火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't follow the lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.64,0:45:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小心，不然哈比人会跌进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful now! Or Hobbits go down to join the dead ones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.68,0:45:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,自己也点亮小小的鬼火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and light little candles of their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.04,0:46:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.00,0:47:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咕鲁？ - 别跟着鬼火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gollum? - Don't follow the lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.84,0:47:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咕鲁？ - 佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gollum! - Mr. Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.88,0:47:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.60,0:47:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好亮哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So bright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.80,0:47:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好美哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.76,0:47:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.04,0:48:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.76,0:48:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,主人应该休息了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master should be resting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.12,0:48:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,主人一定要保留体力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master needs to keep up his strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.16,0:48:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？ - 别问我们，这不关你事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Mustn't ask us. Not its business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.64,0:48:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,咕鲁，咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gollum. Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.32,0:48:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫说，你以前是住河边的哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf told me you were one of the river-folk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.28,0:48:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,冰透心、寒彻骨，离乡背井真辛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold be heart and hand and bone Cold be travelers far from home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.52,0:48:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你的一生很悲惨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said your life was a sad story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.32,0:48:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,向前走、无退路，日月星辰暗无光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They do not see what lies ahead When sun has failed and moon is dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.00,0:48:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前也是一个哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were not so very different from a Hobbit once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.16,0:48:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.16,0:48:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.08,0:48:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫我什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.96,0:48:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那曾是你的名字，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was your name once, wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.32,0:48:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.52,0:48:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.72,0:48:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.16,0:49:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.72,0:49:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,黑骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black Riders!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.52,0:49:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快躲！快躲！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide! Hide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.48,0:49:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Frodo. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.92,0:49:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快，他们会看到我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! They will see us! They will see us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.36,0:49:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我以为他们死了 - 死了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought they were dead. - Dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.16,0:49:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是不会死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you cannot kill them. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.24,0:50:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,戒灵！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wraiths!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.60,0:50:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,骑着飞兽的戒灵！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wraiths on wings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.76,0:50:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在召唤它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are calling for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.00,0:50:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在召唤宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are calling for the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.68,0:50:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多，没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo! It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.00,0:50:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.24,0:50:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧，哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, Hobbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.32,0:50:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,黑门就快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Gate is very close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.12,0:50:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,半兽人的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orc blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.04,0:51:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这些足迹很奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are strange tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.08,0:51:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿的空气好浓密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The air is so close in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.24,0:51:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这座森林很古老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This forest is old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.44,0:51:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,非常古老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.20,0:51:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,充满了记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full of memory...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.12,0:51:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,和愤怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.64,0:51:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,树木在互相交谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trees are speaking to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.68,0:51:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,金灵！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimli!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.36,0:51:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,放下斧头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower your ax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.12,0:51:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也有感觉，老友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have feelings, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.40,0:51:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵是始作俑者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Elves began it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.56,0:51:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们唤醒树木，教他们说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waking up the trees, teaching them to speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.84,0:51:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,会说话的树木{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talking trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.84,0:52:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这些树能说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do trees have to talk about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.04,0:52:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,除了松鼠粪有多臭之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except the consistency of squirrel droppings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.84,0:52:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么东西{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.88,0:52:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见什么？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.20,0:52:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,白袍巫师接近我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The White Wizard approaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.80,0:52:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他说话，他会对我们下咒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not let him speak. He will put a spell on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.68,0:52:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,动作要快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.52,0:53:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在找两个小哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are tracking the footsteps of two young Hobbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.76,0:53:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.36,0:53:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们前天经过这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They passed this way the day before yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.12,0:53:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们遇到料想不到的人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They met someone they did not expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.52,0:53:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这下你们放心了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that comfort you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.80,0:53:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.28,0:53:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快现身！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.12,0:53:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It cannot be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.08,0:53:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.72,0:53:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你是萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mistook you for Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.44,0:53:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我是萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.72,0:53:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,应该就是身为白袍巫师的萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or rather, Saruman as he should have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.56,0:53:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你跌下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.52,0:53:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我跌入火海…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through fire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.24,0:53:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,…和深水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.00,0:53:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我从最深的地心到最高的山峰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the lowest dungeon to the highest peak...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.68,0:54:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,和魔苟斯的炎魔展开殊死战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fought with the Balrog of Morgoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.28,0:54:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我击败强敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until at last I threw down my enemy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.16,0:54:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把他的尸身丢到山下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and smote his ruin upon the mountainside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.68,0:54:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我被黑暗吞蚀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darkness took me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.00,0:54:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道失去意识多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I strayed out of thought and time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.80,0:54:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,日换星移{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stars wheeled overhead...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.16,0:54:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,每一天都像一辈子一样漫长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and every day was as long as a life age of the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.80,0:54:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这并不是结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was not the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.16,0:54:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于重获新生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt life in me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.92,0:55:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我被送回来…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been sent back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.64,0:55:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,…完成使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until my task is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.64,0:55:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.20,0:55:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.60,0:55:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.20,0:55:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前叫做甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was what they used to call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.84,0:55:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,灰袍巫师甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf the Grey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.44,0:55:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我以前的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.40,0:55:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.80,0:55:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在是白袍巫师甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Gandalf the White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.92,0:55:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我在危急时刻…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I come back to you now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.12,0:55:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,…回来帮助你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the turn of the tide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.76,0:55:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的旅程开敔了全新的一页{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One stage of your journey is over. Another begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.48,0:55:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们必须尽快赶到伊多拉斯 - 伊多拉斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We must travel to Edoras with all speed. - Edoras?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.56,0:55:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,路途很遥远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is no short distance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.84,0:55:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,听说洛汗国有难，国王受到奸臣蛊惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hear of trouble in Rohan. It goes ill with the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.28,0:55:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,事情没那么好解决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and it will not be easily cured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.52,0:55:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们大老远赶来这儿是白费工夫罗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we have run all this way for nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.12,0:55:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要把那两个可怜的哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we to leave those poor Hobbits here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.28,0:56:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,丢在这座阴森可怕的森林吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this horrid, dark, dank tree-infested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.12,0:56:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说美妙迷人…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, charming...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.44,0:56:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,…美妙迷人的森林啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quite charming forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.76,0:56:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里和皮聘来到法贡森林并不只是巧合而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was more than mere chance that brought Merry and Pippin to Fangorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.60,0:56:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有一股强大力量多年来一直在这儿沉睡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A great power has been sleeping here for many long years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.12,0:56:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里和皮聘的到来就像是一颗小石子…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coming of Merry and Pippin will be like the falling of small stones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.72,0:56:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,…会引起一场大山崩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that starts an avalanche in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.20,0:56:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是没有变，老友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I n one thing you have not changed, dear friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.40,0:56:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你说话还是像在打哑谜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still speak in riddles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.80,0:56:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有一件自远古以来就没发生的事即将发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thing is about to happen that has not happened since the Elder Days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.40,0:56:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,树人将从睡梦中醒来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ents are going to wake up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.56,0:56:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发现自己的力量强大 - 力量强大？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and find that they are strong. - Strong?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.84,0:56:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那敢情好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.16,0:56:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别再碎碎念了，矮人先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So stop your fretting, Master Dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.00,0:57:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里跟皮聘很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry and Pippin are quite safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.36,0:57:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,往后他们也会比你们安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, they are far safer than you are about to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.20,0:57:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的甘道夫比以前还会唠叨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This new Gandalf's more grumpy than the old one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.20,0:57:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那是米亚拉斯神驹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is one of the Mearas...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.84,0:57:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我被下了咒看错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless my eyes are cheated by some spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.20,0:57:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是影疾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shadowfax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.04,0:58:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他是马中之王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the lord of all horses...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.32,0:58:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他陪伴我度过重重难关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and has been my friend through many dangers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.48,0:58:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的花揪树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O rowan mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.24,0:58:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见你沐浴在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you shine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.24,0:58:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,金黄的阳光里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Upon a summer's day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.84,0:58:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,金红色的皇冠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Upon your head How golden-red{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.52,0:58:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是你头上的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crown you bore aloft{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.44,0:58:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好美的一首诗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a beautiful verse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.96,0:58:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还要很远吗？ - 别心急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it much further? - Bru-ra-hroom. Don't be hasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.08,0:58:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以说很远吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might call it far, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.24,0:58:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家在森林深处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My home lies deep in the forest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.24,0:59:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,靠近山脚的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}near the roots of the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.44,0:59:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应甘道夫要保护你们安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told Gandalf I would keep you safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.32,0:59:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定会好好保护你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And safe is where I'll keep you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.60,0:59:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这首诗你们一定也会喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you will enjoy this next one too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.36,0:59:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我自己写的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of my own compositions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.52,0:59:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.88,0:59:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在沉睡的叶下树木的美梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beneath the roof of sleeping leaves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.20,0:59:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,缓缓成真实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the dreams of trees unfold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.24,0:59:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,当林地翠绿清凉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When woodland halls are green and cool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.88,0:59:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,西风吹拂时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the wind is in the West{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.40,0:59:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快回到我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.64,0:59:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快回到我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.24,0:59:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,赞颂我的领地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And say my land is best{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.16,1:00:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,睡吧，小夏尔人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep, little Shirelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.00,1:00:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别管夜晚的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heed no nightly noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.72,1:00:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,一觉睡到天亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep till morning light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.28,1:00:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我在森林里有事要忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have business in the forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.60,1:00:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我要召集好多树人，很多树人都会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are many to call. Many that must come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.36,1:00:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗降临法贡森林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Shadow lies on Fangorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.20,1:00:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的树木很快就会枯萎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The withering of all woods is drawing near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.48,1:00:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,东方的阴影逐渐成形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The veiling shadow that glowers in the east takes shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.56,1:00:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦对敌人绝不留情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron will suffer no rival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.56,1:01:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他的邪眼在巴拉多的高塔虎视眈眈地看着一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the summit of Barad-dur, his Eye watches ceaselessly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.04,1:01:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他的力量仍未强大到可以无畏无惧的程度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he is not so mighty yet that he is above fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.48,1:01:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他的心中充满疑虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doubt ever gnaws at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.64,1:01:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谣言已传到他耳中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rumor has reached him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.36,1:01:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,努曼诺尔的传人仍活在世上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heir of Numenor still lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.28,1:01:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦怕你，亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron fears you, Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.44,1:01:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他怕你会成为心腹大患{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fears what you may become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.88,1:01:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他才急着向人类世界进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so he'll strike hard and fast at the world of Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.48,1:01:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他会利用他的傀儡萨鲁曼消灭洛汗国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will use his puppet Saruman to destroy Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.28,1:01:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大战即将来临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.92,1:01:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗人必须捍卫祖国，这就是我们第一个桃战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rohan must defend itself, and therein lies our first challenge...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.68,1:01:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,因为洛汗国国势衰弱，随时都会灭亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for Rohan is weak and ready to fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.28,1:01:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,国王心中受到蛊惑，这也是萨鲁曼的老伎俩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king's mind is enslaved, it's an old device of Saruman's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.16,1:01:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他对希优顿的的箝制非常强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His hold over King Theoden is now very strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.44,1:01:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦和萨鲁曼正在节节逼近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron and Saruman are tightening the noose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.96,1:01:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他们诡计多端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for all their cunning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.28,1:01:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是有一个优势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have one advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.96,1:02:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还没找到魔戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring remains hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.60,1:02:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们压根没想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that we should seek to destroy it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.72,1:02:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们准备要摧毁魔戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has not yet entered their darkest dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.32,1:02:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以一个哈比人正带着敌人的利器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so the weapon of the enemy is moving towards Mordor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.76,1:02:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,朝着魔多前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the hands of a Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.44,1:02:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他每天都更接近末日火山的烈焰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each day brings it closer to the fires of Mount Doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.68,1:02:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们必须相信佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must trust now in Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.48,1:02:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这场大战的关键就是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything depends upon speed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.48,1:02:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,…他能不能尽快达到目的地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the secrecy of his quest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.44,1:02:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别后侮你丢下他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not regret your decision to leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.68,1:02:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多必须一个人完成任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo must finish this task alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.16,1:02:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.68,1:02:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆跟他一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam went with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.00,1:02:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.40,1:02:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此，很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he, indeed? Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.64,1:02:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.08,1:03:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,魔多的黑门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Gate of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.72,1:03:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, save us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.04,1:03:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我老爸看到我们现在这样，一定会碎碎念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My old Gaffer would have a thing or two to say if he could see us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.52,1:03:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,主人说他要到魔多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master says to show him the way into Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.12,1:03:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈就乖乖带主人去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So good Smeagol does, master says so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.72,1:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.72,1:03:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.28,1:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们闯不进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't get past that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.76,1:04:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.28,1:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.96,1:04:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,它打开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's opening!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.56,1:04:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,下面有路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see a way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.24,1:04:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆，不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.56,1:04:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,主人！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.76,1:06:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我并没有要你跟我一起来 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I do not ask you to come with me, Sam. - I know, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.04,1:06:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了里面，就算彼精灵斗蓬也没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt even these Elvish cloaks will hide us in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.64,1:06:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去吧 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.04,1:06:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No, master!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.24,1:06:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会抓到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They catch you! They catch you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.52,1:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别把它交给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.04,1:06:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.92,1:06:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直在找它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always he is looking for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.12,1:06:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝也想回到他手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the precious is wanting to go back to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.24,1:06:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们不能让他拿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we mustn't let him have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.56,1:06:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，有另一条路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! There's another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.84,1:06:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,更隐密、更黑暗的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More secret. A dark way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.80,1:07:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么不早说？ - 因为主人没有问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why haven't you spoken of this before? - Because master did not ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.92,1:07:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他在动歪脑筋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's up to something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.64,1:07:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说有另一条路到魔多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying there's another way into Mordor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.44,1:07:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对，有一条小路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. There's a path...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.32,1:07:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,和一些阶梯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and some stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.04,1:07:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,然后…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.88,1:07:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,…有一条隧道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.16,1:07:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他都带我们到这儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's led us this far, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.12,1:07:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多，不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.68,1:07:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他信守他的承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been true to his word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.00,1:07:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.36,1:07:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,带路吧，史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead the way, Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.60,1:07:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈总是很乐意帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good Smeagol always helps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.52,1:08:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.92,1:08:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,树须？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treebeard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.68,1:08:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他跑哪儿去了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where has he gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.20,1:08:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨晚做了一个美梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had the loveliest dream last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.28,1:08:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我梦到一个大木桶，里面装满烟草{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was this large barrel, full of pipe-weed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.16,1:08:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一口气把它抽完，结果…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we smoked all of it. And then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.16,1:08:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,…你就生病了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.72,1:08:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我抽一口烟斗，我就算死也愿意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd give anything for a whiff of Old Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.04,1:08:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到没有？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.04,1:09:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.40,1:09:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,事情有点不对劲，很不对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's not right here. Not right at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.80,1:09:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚刚说了一句…树语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just said something... Treeish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.92,1:09:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,才没有，我只是伸个懒腰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't. I was just stretching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.44,1:09:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你变高了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're taller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.88,1:09:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 你呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.56,1:09:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 比什么高？ - 比我高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Than what? - Than me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.68,1:09:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都比你高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always been taller than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.96,1:09:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘，大家都知道我比较高，你才是矮冬瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin, everyone knows I'm the tall one. You're the short one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.44,1:09:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托，梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.12,1:09:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你最多只有三尺六寸？对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're what? Three-foot-six? At the most?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.56,1:09:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,至于我就快三尺七了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whereas me, I'm pushing 3'7".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.52,1:09:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,三尺八{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3'8"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.72,1:09:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,三尺八{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three-foot-eight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.60,1:10:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.32,1:10:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里，别喝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry, don't! Don't drink it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.84,1:10:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.48,1:10:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,树须说你不能乱喝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Treebeard said that you shouldn't have any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.00,1:10:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我也要喝 - 喝了会死人耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want some! - It could well be dangerous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.08,1:10:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me it back. Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.08,1:10:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.32,1:10:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我的腿被夹住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got my leg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.12,1:10:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.00,1:10:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.32,1:10:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Away with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.36,1:11:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该醒来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should not be waking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.68,1:11:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去吃泥土，树根挖深一点，水喝多一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat earth. Dig deep. Drink water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.24,1:11:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,然后去睡吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.12,1:11:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Away with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.20,1:11:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，森林苏醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, the forest is waking up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.04,1:11:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.60,1:11:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,树木变得狂野危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trees have grown wild and dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.68,1:11:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们心中燃起熊熊怒火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anger festers in their hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.56,1:11:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,内心充满敌意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black are their thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.36,1:11:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,眼中充满仇恨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strong is their hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.08,1:11:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很可能会伤害你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will harm you if they can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.04,1:11:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,树人的数量越来越少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are too few of us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.76,1:11:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,想要约束树木也越来越难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too few of us Ents left to manage them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.40,1:11:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这么长寿，怎么会只剩这么少呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are there so few of you when you have lived so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.20,1:11:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 树人没有小孩吗？ - 布-拉-鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are there Ent children? - Bru-ra-hroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.56,1:11:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们树人有好久好久都没有生小树人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There have been no Entings for a terrible long count of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.40,1:12:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 我们的树妻都消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why is that? - We lost the Entwives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.88,1:12:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真是遗憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.44,1:12:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她们是怎么死的？ - 死？不是啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did they die? - Die? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.56,1:12:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说她们消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.96,1:12:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,到现在都找不到她们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we cannot find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.20,1:12:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在夏尔没见过树妻吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose you've seen Entwives in the Shire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.60,1:12:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't say that I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.68,1:12:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢，皮聘？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, Pip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.16,1:12:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她们长什么样子？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do they look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.00,1:12:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.12,1:12:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,伊多拉斯以及梅杜西金殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edoras and the Golden Hall of Meduseld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.76,1:13:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国国王希优顿的皇宫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There dwells Theoden, King of Rohan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.08,1:13:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他的身心受到蛊惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose mind is overthrown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.16,1:13:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼控制了希优顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman's hold over King Theoden is now very strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.08,1:13:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,王上，您的儿子…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, your son...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.44,1:13:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,…他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.16,1:13:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,王上？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.20,1:13:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.16,1:13:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,您不去看他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you not go to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.52,1:13:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,您什么也不做吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you do nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.12,1:13:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谨言慎行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful what you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.32,1:13:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不受欢迎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not look for welcome here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.52,1:14:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定是昨晚去世的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he must have died sometime in the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.88,1:14:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,国王在一夜间失去独子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a tragedy for the king...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.24,1:14:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,和王储真是不幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to lose his only son and heir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.32,1:14:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道，他的死一定让你很难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand. His passing is hard to accept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.04,1:14:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是你的兄长也弃你不顾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially now that your brother has deserted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.08,1:14:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让我一个人静一静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave me alone, snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.04,1:14:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你的确是孤零零的一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, but you are alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.32,1:14:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,天晓得你在黑暗中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows what you've spoken to the darkness...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.24,1:14:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,受了多少煎熬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the bitter watches of the night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.84,1:14:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你的生命一点一滴地凋谢枯萎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when all your life seems to shrink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.72,1:14:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你受到四面高墙禁锢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The walls of your bower closing in about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.08,1:14:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如同笼中鸟一般渴望自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hutch to trammel some wild thing in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.92,1:14:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这么美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.08,1:14:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,却如此冷漠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.20,1:15:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就像寒冬过后的春泉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a morning of pale spring...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.64,1:15:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,依然那么地冰冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}still clinging to winter's chill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.80,1:15:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的话是毒药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your words are poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.88,1:16:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就连墓园都比这儿有生气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find more cheer in a graveyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.72,1:17:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不能带武器见希优顿王，灰袍巫师甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot allow you before Theoden King so armed, Gandalf Greyhame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.04,1:17:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是葛力马巧言之令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By order of Grima Wormtongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.92,1:17:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your staff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.08,1:17:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你就让一个老人带着手杖吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would not part an old man from his walking stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.44,1:18:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,王上，灰袍巫师甘道夫来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, Gandalf the Grey is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.60,1:18:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他是恶兆的信差{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a herald of woe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.32,1:18:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你近来似乎不太欢迎来访者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The courtesy of your hall is somewhat lessened of late...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.88,1:18:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoden King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.00,1:18:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不欢迎他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.44,1:18:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要欢迎你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I welcome you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.28,1:18:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,乌鸦嘴甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf Stormcrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.12,1:18:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好，王上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A just question, my liege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.60,1:18:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,时候这么晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Late is the hour...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.64,1:18:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这名江湖术士却突然跑来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in which this conjurer chooses to appear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.40,1:18:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我替他取名为噩耗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lathspell I name him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.64,1:18:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,噩耗就是不受欢迎的恶客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ill news is an ill guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.68,1:19:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴，别在这儿搬弄是非{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be silent. Keep your forked tongue behind your teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.44,1:19:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我通过烈焰和死亡的试炼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have not passed through fire and death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.52,1:19:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不是为了跟蠢材做口舌之争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bandy crooked words with a witless worm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.76,1:19:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他的手杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His staff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.04,1:19:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你们没收巫师的手杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to take the wizard's staff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.52,1:19:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoden...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.00,1:19:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,塞哲尔之子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}son of Thengel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.36,1:19:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你活在阴影底下太久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}too long have you sat in the Shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.68,1:19:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好乖乖别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would stay still if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.16,1:19:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hearken to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.68,1:19:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你从咒语中…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I release you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.04,1:19:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,…释放出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.56,1:19:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里没有力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no power here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.76,1:20:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,灰袍巫师甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf the Grey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.80,1:20:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼，我要把你逼出来，就像把剧毒逼出伤口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will draw you, Saruman, as poison is drawn from a wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.28,1:20:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.24,1:20:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我一走希优顿就会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I go, Theoden dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.80,1:20:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀不了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did not kill me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.16,1:20:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,更杀不了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will not kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.24,1:20:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rohan is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.40,1:20:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.28,1:21:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我认得你的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.96,1:21:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧玫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eowyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.56,1:21:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧玫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eowyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.12,1:21:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.84,1:21:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸自由空气吧，老友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe the free air again, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.08,1:22:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我仿佛做了一场噩梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dark have been my dreams of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.84,1:22:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你握住宝剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fingers would remember their old strength better...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.76,1:22:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,从前的力量就会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if they grasped your sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.84,1:23:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,王上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.04,1:23:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我自始至终只想服侍您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever served you, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.24,1:23:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你只想用邪术让我像小狗一样趴在你脚下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your leechcraft would have had me crawling on all fours like a beast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.24,1:23:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,请别放逐我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send me not from your sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.48,1:23:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不，王上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my lord! No, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.40,1:23:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,饶了他吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.32,1:23:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,已经流了太多血了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough blood has been spilt on his account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.68,1:23:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of my way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.28,1:23:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,吾王希优顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail, Theoden King!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.04,1:24:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,希优德呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Theodred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.60,1:24:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is my son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.36,1:25:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,永志花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simbelmyn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.24,1:25:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,它一直生长在先王的坟上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever has it grown on the tombs of my forbearers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.64,1:26:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,现在也将永远覆盖吾儿之墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it shall cover the grave of my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.76,1:26:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,厄运竟然降临在我身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alas that these evil days should be mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.40,1:26:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,少年英年早逝、老人苟延残喘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The young perish and the old linger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.40,1:26:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而我竟然要眼睁睁看着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I should live...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.68,1:26:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国断送在我手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see the last days of my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.24,1:26:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,希优德的死不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theodred's death was not of your making.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.20,1:26:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,白发人不该送黑发人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No parent should have to bury their child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.28,1:26:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他生前很坚强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was strong in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.28,1:26:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他在死后也将与你的先王同在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His spirit will find its way to the halls of your fathers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.48,1:27:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们毫无预警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had no warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.52,1:27:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,手无寸铁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were unarmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.40,1:27:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在野人正穿越西谷，烧毁一路上的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the Wild Men are moving through the Westfold, burning as they go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.36,1:27:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,干草、茅屋和树木{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick, cot and tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.64,1:27:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Mama?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.64,1:27:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是萨鲁曼大军的一小部份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is but a taste of the terror that Saruman will unleash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.04,1:28:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他受到黑暗魔君索伦的控制，力量会日益壮大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the more potent for he is driven now by fear of Sauron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.04,1:28:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须正面迎敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride out and meet him head on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.80,1:28:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,引开他的大军，保护老弱妇孺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Draw him away from your women and children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.60,1:28:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要开战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.40,1:28:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,目前有两千名士兵向北而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have 2000 good men riding north as we speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.40,1:28:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧墨对你忠心耿耿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eomer is loyal to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.20,1:28:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他会率领部下回来为骠骑王奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His men will return and fight for their king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.08,1:28:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们离这儿有三百里格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will be 300 leagues from here by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.68,1:28:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧墨也救不了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eomer cannot help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.52,1:28:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你要我怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what it is you want of me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.48,1:28:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我不能让人民白白送死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I will not bring further death to my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.40,1:28:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想冒险全面开战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not risk open war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.32,1:28:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人已向你宣战，不管你想不想冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open war is upon you, whether you would risk it or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.96,1:28:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就我所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When last I looked...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.04,1:28:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我希优顿才是洛汗国国王，不是亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoden, not Aragorn, was king of Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.56,1:29:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,国王的命令是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what is the king's decision?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.40,1:29:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,国王下令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By order of the king...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.88,1:29:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,全城军民撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the city must empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.52,1:29:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退到圣盔谷碉堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make for the refuge of Helm's Deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.68,1:29:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不要携带笨重的财宝，只要带必需品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not burden yourself with treasures. Take only what provisions you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.76,1:29:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,圣盔谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helm's Deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.44,1:29:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他应该跟敌人一决死战，而不是逃之天天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They flee to the mountains when they should stand and fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.16,1:29:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一国之君就应该扞卫人民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who will defend them if not their king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.28,1:29:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他这么做也是为了人民着想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's only doing what he thinks is best for his people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.96,1:29:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,圣盔谷以前救过他们一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helm's Deep has saved them in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.92,1:29:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那道峡谷无路可退，希优顿这是自寻死路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no way out of that ravine. Theoden is walking into a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.96,1:29:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他认为他们在那儿很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks he's leading them to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.32,1:29:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他们会惨遭屠杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What they will get is a massacre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.04,1:29:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿很固执，我替他担忧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoden has a strong will, but I fear for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.44,1:29:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我也担心洛汗国的存亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear for the survival of Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.24,1:29:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈，他需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will need you before the end, Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.56,1:29:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国人民也需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people of Rohan will need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.72,1:30:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要档住敌人的攻势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The defenses have to hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.64,1:30:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一定档得住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.36,1:30:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,灰袍圣徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Grey Pilgrim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.84,1:30:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以前都这么叫我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what they used to call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.64,1:30:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我在世上活了三百辈子，现在的时间却不够用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three hundred lives of Men I've walked this earth, and now I have no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.32,1:30:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我能找到救兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With luck, my search will not be in vain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.08,1:30:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,五天后等待我的出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look to my coming at first light on the fifth day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.24,1:30:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,破晓时向东方看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At dawn, look to the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.12,1:30:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.00,1:31:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那是匹疯马，你拿他没辙，算了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That horse is half mad, my lord. There's nothing you can do. Leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.40,1:31:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字是布里哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Brego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.96,1:31:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我表兄弟的座骑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was my cousin's horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.08,1:31:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,布里哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.44,1:31:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的名字很有王者之风{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.64,1:32:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说精灵有魔法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have heard of the magic of Elves...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.24,1:32:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是没想到北方游侠也有魔法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I did not look for it in a Ranger from the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.56,1:32:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会说精灵语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You speak as one of their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.76,1:32:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一段时间…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was raised in Rivendell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.48,1:32:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,…在瑞文戴尔长大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.32,1:32:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把他放走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn this fellow free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.00,1:32:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他见过太多战争了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's seen enough of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.28,1:32:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,白袍巫师甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf the White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.32,1:32:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴巫师甘道夫才对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf the Fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.92,1:32:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他自以为穿了白袍就比我厉害吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he seek to humble me with his newfound piety?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.24,1:32:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他身边有三个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were three who followed the wizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.56,1:33:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一个精灵，一个矮人和一个凡人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Elf, a Dwarf and a Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.28,1:33:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你全身都是马臭味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stink of horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.32,1:33:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那个凡人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.24,1:33:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他来自刚铎吗？ - 不，他来自北方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- was he from Gondor? - No, from the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.64,1:33:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他是一名登丹游侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the Dunedain Rangers, I thought he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.60,1:33:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他的衣衫褴褛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His cloth was poor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.32,1:33:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他戴了一只奇怪的戒指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet he bore a strange ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.52,1:33:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,两条绿眼毒蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two serpents with emerald eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.24,1:33:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一条张口大吞，另一条戴着金花皇冠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One devouring, the other crowned with golden flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.24,1:33:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,巴拉汉之戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring of Barahir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.12,1:33:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,灰袍甘道夫以为他找到埃西铎的子嗣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Gandalf Greyhame thinks he has found Isildur's heir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.88,1:33:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,失踪的刚铎王，他是个大傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lost king of Gondor. He is a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.36,1:33:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎王位早已失传{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The line was broken years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.52,1:33:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这不重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It matters not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.20,1:33:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,人类世界将彻底瓦解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world of Men shall fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.88,1:34:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,伊多拉斯第一个遭殃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will begin at Edoras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.96,1:34:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了，加姆林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am ready, Gamling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.08,1:34:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的座骑带来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring my horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.72,1:34:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没被打败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.48,1:34:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.16,1:34:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.92,1:34:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你的剑法不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have some skill with a blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.40,1:35:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿的女人很早就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women of this country learned long ago:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.64,1:35:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没拿剑的人一样会死于剑下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those without swords can still die upon them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.44,1:35:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕死也不怕痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear neither death nor pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.56,1:35:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你怕什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you fear, my lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.04,1:35:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,被困在牢笼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.16,1:35:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,直到老死才接受这个命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To stay behind bars until use and old age accept them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.16,1:35:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候就没有机会证明我的英勇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all chance of valor has gone beyond recall or desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.52,1:35:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是王女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a daughter of kings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.80,1:35:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也是骠骑女战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a shield maiden of Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.40,1:35:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那不会是你的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not think that would be your fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.04,1:36:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿不会留在伊多拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoden will not stay at Edoras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.20,1:36:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他很清楚那儿不安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's vulnerable. He knows this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.48,1:36:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道王都将受到攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will expect an attack on the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.72,1:36:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会逃到圣盔谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will flee to Helm's Deep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.12,1:36:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国的堡垒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the great fortress of Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.68,1:36:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,前往圣盔谷的山路吱岖危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a dangerous road to take through the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.52,1:36:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,前进速度会很缓慢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will be slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.60,1:36:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们当中也会有老弱妇孺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will have women and children with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.88,1:36:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,派出狼骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send out your Warg-riders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.08,1:37:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,臭东西，别走得太远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, stinker, don't go getting too far ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.12,1:37:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么那样？ - 怎样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do you do that? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.96,1:37:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一直骂他，不断找他喳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call him names. Run him down all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.92,1:37:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,因为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.52,1:37:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他很坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because that's what he is, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.80,1:37:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他只会说谎和欺骗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's naught left in him but lies and deceit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.44,1:37:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要魔戒，他只在乎魔戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Ring he wants. It's all he cares about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.40,1:37:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道魔戒对他的折磨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what it did to him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.80,1:37:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,到现在还在折磨他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what it's still doing to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.52,1:37:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要帮助他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to help him, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.76,1:37:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.36,1:37:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我必须相信他会变好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I have to believe he can come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.76,1:37:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你救不了他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't save him, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.84,1:37:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂个屁？你啥也不懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about it? Nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.52,1:38:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，我不知道我是怎么搞的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Sam. I don't know why I said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.56,1:38:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.72,1:38:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为魔戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.16,1:38:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你的视线离不开它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't take your eyes off it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.48,1:38:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.88,1:38:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不吃不喝不睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not eating. You barely sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.48,1:38:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,它控制了你的心智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's taken hold of you, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.92,1:38:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一定要反抗 - 我知道我该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have to fight it. - I know what I have to do, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.80,1:38:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒被交到我手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring was entrusted to me. It's my task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.88,1:38:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我一个人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine! My own!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.44,1:38:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你听听你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you hear yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.76,1:38:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你听起来像谁吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know who you sound like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.68,1:38:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wants it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.00,1:38:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We needs it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.84,1:39:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要得到宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.84,1:39:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从我们身上把它偷走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They stole it from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.44,1:39:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼鬼祟祟的小哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sneaky little Hobbitses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.00,1:39:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,奸诈狡猾、虚伪做作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wicked. Tricksy. False.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.04,1:39:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不，主人不会这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.48,1:39:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,才怪，他最虚伪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, precious. False.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.48,1:39:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会说谎欺骗你、伤害你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will cheat you, hurt you, lie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.12,1:39:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,主人是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master's my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.76,1:39:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有朋友，没有人喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have any friends. Nobody likes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.08,1:39:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不听，我不听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not listening. I'm not listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.76,1:39:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个骗子和小偷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a liar and a thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.40,1:39:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.88,1:39:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,杀人凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.24,1:39:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.44,1:39:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,走开？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.00,1:40:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.48,1:40:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我哪会有你？咕鲁，咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where would you be without me? Gollum. Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.96,1:40:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我救了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saved us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.96,1:40:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的功劳，都是我让我们活下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was me. We survived because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.72,1:40:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在不必靠你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.64,1:40:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.28,1:40:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,主人会照顾我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master looks after us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.28,1:40:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.48,1:40:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.24,1:40:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.16,1:40:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,再也别回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and never come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.12,1:40:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.64,1:40:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快走，别再回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave now and never come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.44,1:40:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你走吧，别再回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave now and never come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.36,1:41:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们叫他走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We told him to go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.24,1:41:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他就走了，宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And away he goes, precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.36,1:41:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他走了！他走了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone! Gone! Gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.52,1:41:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈自由了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol is free!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.24,1:41:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.92,1:41:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你看史麦戈找到什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. See what Smeagol finds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.92,1:41:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很新鲜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.52,1:41:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,肉也很嫩，很好吃哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are tender. They are nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.20,1:41:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，快吃了他们吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they are. Eat them. Eat them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.48,1:41:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你让他吃下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll make him sick, you will...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.28,1:41:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只会害他生病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behaving like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.84,1:41:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,兔肉只有一种煮法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one way to eat a brace of coneys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.88,1:42:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.12,1:42:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,又蠢又肥的哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid, fat Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.96,1:42:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你增蹋了兔肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ruins it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.32,1:42:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里会？根本就没有肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's to ruin? There's hardly any meat on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.08,1:42:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有洋芋就更棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we need is a few good taters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.56,1:42:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,洋芋是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's taters, precious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.76,1:42:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,洋芋是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's taters? Eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.68,1:42:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就是马铃薯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po-ta-toes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.72,1:42:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,煮成洋芋泥、跟肉一起炖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boil them, mash them, stick them in a stew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.48,1:42:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,或是炸成金黄色的洋芋片，配一块酥脆的炸鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lovely, big, golden chips with a nice piece of fried fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.28,1:42:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就连你都无法抗拒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even you couldn't say no to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.52,1:42:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当然可以抗拒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, we could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.92,1:42:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,白白地糟蹋一条鲜鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spoil a nice fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.64,1:42:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,生鱼才够赞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to us raw...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.44,1:42:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,活蹦乱跳的生鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and wriggling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.68,1:42:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己吃臭洋芋片吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep nasty chips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.76,1:42:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是没救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hopeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.32,1:43:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.72,1:43:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们是什么人？ - 坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are they? - Wicked Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.52,1:43:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦的爪牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Servants of Sauron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.80,1:43:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们被叫到魔多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are called to Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.16,1:43:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗魔君在集结邪恶大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dark One is gathering all armies to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.40,1:43:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他很快就会准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be long now. He will soon be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.12,1:43:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备做什么？ - 展开大战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ready to do what? - To make his war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.96,1:43:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一场大战将让黑暗笼罩大地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last war that will cover all the world in Shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.40,1:43:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶路，来吧，山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to get moving. Come on, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.64,1:43:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.36,1:44:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.60,1:44:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那是猛玛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an oliphaunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.12,1:44:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,老家的人绝对不会相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one at home will believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.32,1:44:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.56,1:45:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们逗留太久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lingered here too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.04,1:45:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧，山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.84,1:45:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,住手，我们只是旅人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! We're innocent travelers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.24,1:45:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方没有旅人，只有黑暗魔君的爪牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no travelers in this land. Only servants of the Dark Tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.52,1:45:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的旅行必须保密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are bound to an errand of secrecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.76,1:45:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,只要是黑暗魔君敌人，就不能阻止我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those that claim to oppose the enemy would do well not to hinder us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.32,1:45:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The enemy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.44,1:45:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他一样也把你视为敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His sense of duty was no less than yours, I deem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.40,1:46:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道他叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wonder what his name is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.04,1:46:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,或是来自哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.28,1:46:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也不知道他是否真的内心邪恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he was really evil at heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.36,1:46:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他到底是为了什么才远离家园前来作战？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What lies or threats led him on this long march from home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.44,1:46:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他宁愿留下家乡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he would not rather have stayed there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.12,1:46:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,过着和平的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.16,1:46:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,战争之中无人能幸免于难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War will make corpses of us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.40,1:46:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,绑住他们的双手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bind their hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.28,1:46:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，女矮人是很少见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true, you don't see many Dwarf women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.20,1:46:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说，她们的长相和声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in fact, they are so alike in voice and appearance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.04,1:46:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,常常被误认为男矮人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they're often mistaken for Dwarf men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.60,1:46:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她们也有胡子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the beards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.72,1:46:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至有人相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This, in turn, has given rise to the belief...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.00,1:47:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,女矮人根本不存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there are no Dwarf women...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.04,1:47:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人都是从地洞蹦出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that Dwarves just spring out of holes in the ground...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.96,1:47:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这当然是无稽之谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is, of course, ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.96,1:47:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事，别紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. Nobody panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.64,1:47:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我是故意凸槌的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was deliberate. It was deliberate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.60,1:47:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我有好久没看到我侄女开怀大笑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen my niece smile for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.72,1:47:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他父亲的尸体被带回来时，她还是个小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was a girl when they brought her father back dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.64,1:47:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她父亲被半兽人杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut down by Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.12,1:47:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她看着她母亲悲痛而逝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She watched her mother succumb to grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.72,1:47:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,只留下她活在恐惧中，还要照顾她的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she was left alone, to tend her king in growing fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.60,1:47:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她必须服侍一个应该视她如己出的顽固老人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doomed to wait upon an old man who should have loved her as a father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.16,1:47:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,金灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.64,1:48:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不饿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I couldn't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.92,1:48:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不饿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.24,1:48:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我煮了一锅炖肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made some stew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.04,1:48:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不多，但是还很烫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't much, but it's hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.12,1:48:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.68,1:48:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好吃 - 真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.20,1:48:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我叔叔跟我说了一件匪夷所思的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My uncle told me a strange thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.88,1:48:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你曾跟我祖父塞哲尔并肩作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said that you rode to war with Thengel, my grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.36,1:49:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定是搞错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he must be mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.08,1:49:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿王的记性很好，当时他还只是个小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King Theoden has a good memory. He was only a small child at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.64,1:49:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那你至少有六十岁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you must be at least 60.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.92,1:49:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,七十岁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.92,1:49:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可能有八十岁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you cannot be 80!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.92,1:49:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,八十七岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighty-seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.40,1:49:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你是登丹人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are one of the Dunedain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.56,1:49:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,努曼诺尔人的后裔，你们比别人都长寿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A descendant of Numenor, blessed with long life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.92,1:49:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你们这种人已经消失，成为传奇人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was said that your race had passed into legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.20,1:49:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这种人所剩不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are few of us left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.12,1:49:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,北方王国早已被毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Northern Kingdom was destroyed long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.76,1:49:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾，请多吃一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Please, eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.76,1:50:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,暮星的光芒不会减弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The light of the Evenstar does not wax and wane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.68,1:50:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要给谁就给谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is mine to give to whom I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.96,1:50:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我的心一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.80,1:50:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快睡吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.68,1:50:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经睡着了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.64,1:50:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是一场梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.80,1:50:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那么这一定是美梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it is a good dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.04,1:50:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,睡吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.16,1:51:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾告诉我{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.16,1:51:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这一天会来到{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.36,1:51:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是结束，而是开始{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.20,1:51:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要跟佛罗多去{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.04,1:51:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你要走的路{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.48,1:51:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不见我要走的路{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.92,1:51:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你要走的路已经在你眼前{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.68,1:51:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能犹豫不定{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.08,1:51:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,亚玫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arwen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.56,1:51:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你什么都不相信{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.20,1:51:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那就相信真心{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.44,1:52:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我们俩{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.48,1:52:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.48,1:52:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,给你那枚宝石的女人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The woman who gave you that jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.24,1:52:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的时代结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our time here is ending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.64,1:52:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,亚玫也要离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arwen's time is ending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.96,1:52:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,让她走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.40,1:52:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,让她坐船前往西方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her take the ship into the west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.60,1:53:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,让她带着对你的爱到海外仙境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her bear away her love for you to the Undying Lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.84,1:53:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,她对你的爱将永远常青{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it will be ever green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.12,1:53:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她只有回忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But never more than memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.80,1:53:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让我女儿留下来等死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not leave my daughter here to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.96,1:53:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是心存希望才会留下来 - 她是为了你才留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She stays because she still has hope. - She stays for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.80,1:53:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,她应该跟她的族人在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She belongs with her people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.52,1:53:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你连道别都不肯就要走？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.60,1:53:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你能趁天刚破晓就这样悄悄溜走？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.64,1:53:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我上了战场就不会回来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.88,1:53:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你低估了自己的实力{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.84,1:53:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定会回来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.44,1:53:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思不是在战场上战死{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.68,1:53:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你是什么意思？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.28,1:53:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你有机会过另一种生活{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.36,1:54:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,远离战争、伤痛和绝望{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.40,1:54:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要我走？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you saying this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.80,1:54:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我是凡人，你是精灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am mortal. You are Elf-kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.44,1:54:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是一场梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a dream, Arwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.52,1:54:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一场美梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.28,1:54:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信你的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.52,1:54:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这属于你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This belongs to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.08,1:54:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是送你的礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.36,1:54:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,留着它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.40,1:54:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.40,1:54:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她要跟其他的精灵坐船到海外仙境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is sailing to the Undying Lands with all that is left of her kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.44,1:55:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.40,1:55:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈玛？ - 我不确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hama? - I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.00,1:55:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,座狼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wargs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.60,1:55:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他是斥候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A scout!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.60,1:56:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？那是什么？ - 狼骑士，我们受到攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? What do you see? - Warg! We're under attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.48,1:56:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快把他们带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.40,1:56:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,骑士全都到前锋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All riders to the head of the column.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.16,1:56:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快让我上去，我也是骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get me up here. I'm a rider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.32,1:56:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.84,1:56:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你快带人民到圣盔谷，快去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must lead the people to Helm's Deep, and make haste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.48,1:56:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可以作战 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can fight. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.68,1:56:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你要为了我带他们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must do this, for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.72,1:56:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.84,1:56:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 前进，我是说向前冲 - 快到低地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Forward. I mean, charge forward. - Make for the lower ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.36,1:56:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好，快呀 - 聚在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it! Go on! - Stay together!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.20,1:58:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快来领死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring your pretty face to my ax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.32,1:58:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那一只算我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one counts as mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.56,1:58:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,臭东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stinking creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.44,2:00:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.04,2:00:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.52,2:00:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快说他怎么了，我就让你死得痛快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what happened and I will ease your passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.60,2:00:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.60,2:00:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,…死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.84,2:00:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他跌下悬崖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took a little tumble off the cliff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.36,2:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.60,2:01:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把伤者放到马背上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the wounded on horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.48,2:01:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,艾辛格的座狼会再回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wolves of Isengard will return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.08,2:01:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把死者留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.64,2:01:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.32,2:01:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 终于到了 - 圣盔谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- At last! - Helm's Deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.04,2:01:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,到了，圣盔谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is, Helm's Deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.48,2:01:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're safe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.80,2:01:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们安全了，王女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're safe, my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.84,2:01:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.40,2:02:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 伊欧参！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mama! - Eothain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.00,2:02:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,斐黛！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.28,2:02:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 其它的呢？ - 我们只抢救了这么多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is the rest? - This is all we could save, my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.96,2:02:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,带到山洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it to the caves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.48,2:02:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,迎接国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make way for the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.26,2:03:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,迎接希优顿，迎接骠骑王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make way for Theoden. Make way for the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.04,2:03:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好少人，回来的人好少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So few. So few of you have returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.56,2:03:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的人民安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our people are safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.16,2:03:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是却牺牲很多条人命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have paid for it with many lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.56,2:03:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,王女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.80,2:03:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Aragorn...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.24,2:03:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他人呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.44,2:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.68,2:04:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在城墙后方派重兵驻守{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Draw all our forces behind the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.80,2:04:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,档住城门，派哨兵守住城池{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bar the gate. And set a watch on the surround.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.00,2:04:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不能打仗的人怎么办？女人和小孩？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What of those who cannot fight, my lord? The women and children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.28,2:04:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们进入洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them into the caves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.76,2:04:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼别想攻下这座铜墙铁壁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman's arm will have grown long indeed if he thinks he can reach us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.64,2:04:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,圣盔谷只有一个弱点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helm's Deep has one weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.20,2:04:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,它的外墙是巨石砌成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its outer wall is solid rock...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.72,2:04:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它的基座有一条渠道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but for a small culvert at its base...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.96,2:04:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,只比排水管大一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is little more than a drain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.60,2:04:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这行不通，火怎么烧得了石头？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How? How can fire undo stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.92,2:04:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你要用什么方法摧毁城墙？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of device could bring down the wall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.12,2:04:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能攻下城墙，圣盔谷就会瓦解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the wall is breached, Helm's Deep will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.28,2:04:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就算能攻下城墙，还要有几千名士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if it is breached, it would take a number beyond reckoning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.00,2:04:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,才攻得进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thousands, to storm the Keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.72,2:04:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,成千上万名士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tens of thousands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.32,2:05:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,大人，我们没有这种大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, my lord, there is no such force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.32,2:05:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一股新势力崛起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new power is rising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.56,2:05:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,它即将获得胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its victory is at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.24,2:05:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.72,2:05:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗人的鲜血将染红大地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the land will be stained with the blood of Rohan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.24,2:05:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,向圣盔谷进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}March to Helm's Deep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.76,2:05:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不能留下活口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave none alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.76,2:05:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,开战了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To war!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.16,2:05:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,人类将看不到明天的曙光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no dawn for Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.84,2:06:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,南方有烟硝升起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. There's smoke to the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.08,2:06:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,最近艾辛格那个方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is always smoke rising...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.40,2:06:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一直有烟硝升起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Isengard these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.48,2:06:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,艾辛格？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isengard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.28,2:06:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.52,2:06:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼会来我的森林漫步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when Saruman would walk in my woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.20,2:06:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在他却满脑子都是钢铁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now he has a mind of metal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.28,2:06:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还有铁轮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and wheels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.44,2:06:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他对大自然不再成兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He no longer cares for growing things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.12,2:06:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.92,2:06:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼的大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Saruman's army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.28,2:06:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,开战了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war has started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.16,2:07:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,愿主神保佑你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the grace of the Valar protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.84,2:08:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,布里哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.80,2:08:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,亚玫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.36,2:08:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你该走了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.28,2:08:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,船要开往瓦林诺，去吧，现在还来得及{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.84,2:08:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have made my choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.08,2:08:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is not coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.40,2:08:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没有希望，你为何还要留恋？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you linger here when there is no hope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.60,2:09:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一线希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is still hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.76,2:09:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就算亚拉冈活下来，你们还是会分开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Aragorn survives this war, you will still be parted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.92,2:09:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就算亚拉冈打败索伦成为人皇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Sauron is defeated and Aragorn made king...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.08,2:09:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,而你的愿望也都实现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all that you hope for comes true...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.76,2:09:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他还是逃不了死亡的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will still have to taste the bitterness of mortality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.72,2:09:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是战死或是老死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether by the sword or the slow decay of time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.88,2:09:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈都难逃一死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.64,2:09:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你将得不到安慰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there will be no comfort for you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.40,2:09:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,永远为他的死伤心难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no comfort to ease the pain of his passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.44,2:09:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了以后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will come to death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.32,2:09:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,身为人皇的英勇形象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an image of the splendor of the kings of Men...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.12,2:09:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,将留在世人心中永不磨灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in glory undimmed before the breaking of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.84,2:10:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你，我的爱女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you, my daughter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.64,2:10:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你将活在恒久不变的黑暗中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will linger on in darkness and in doubt...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.80,2:10:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就像没有星光的冬夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as nightfall in winter that comes without a star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.32,2:10:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你将满怀伤悲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you will dwell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.88,2:10:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,住在一天一天干枯的老树下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bound to your grief under the fading trees...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.48,2:10:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,直到世界改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until all the world is changed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.68,2:10:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你也虚度了你漫长的一生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the long years of your life are utterly spent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.72,2:10:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,亚玫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.52,2:10:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这儿什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing for you here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.48,2:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,只有死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.40,2:11:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不爱我吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.08,2:11:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你，父亲{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.00,2:12:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人的力量越来越强大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power of the enemy is growing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.80,2:12:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦将利用他的傀儡萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron will use his puppet, Saruman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.64,2:12:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭洛汗人民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to destroy the people of Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.12,2:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,艾辛格的邪恶大军出动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isengard has been unleashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.04,2:12:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦的邪眼把目标转向刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Eye of Sauron now turns to Gondor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.56,2:12:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,人类最后的自由国土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last free kingdom of Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.72,2:13:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他将迅雷不及掩耳地进攻刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His war on this country will come swiftly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.84,2:13:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他感到魔戒离他很近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He senses the Ring is close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.12,2:13:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒持有者的意志越来越薄弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The strength of the Ring-bearer is failing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:13.76,2:13:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多的内心深处知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In his heart, Frodo begins to understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.32,2:13:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这场旅程将夺去他的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the quest will claim his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:23.40,2:13:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.16,2:13:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你也预见到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have foreseen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.08,2:13:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们必须冒的险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the risk we all took.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.92,2:13:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当邪恶力量聚集，魔戒的意志力就会加强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the gathering dark, the will of the Ring grows strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:44.32,2:13:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,它一心一意想回到人类手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It works hard now to find its way back into the hands of Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.92,2:13:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,因为人类很容易受到它的诱惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men, who are so easily seduced by its power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.56,2:13:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻的刚铎将军只要伸出手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The young captain of Gondor has but to extend his hand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.32,2:14:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,将魔戒占为己有，中土世界就会沦陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take the Ring for his own, and the world will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.84,2:14:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就快了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is close now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.84,2:14:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它就快成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So close to achieving its goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:14.24,2:14:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦即将奴役世上所有生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Sauron will have dominion over all life on this Earth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.00,2:14:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至带来中土世界的灭亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even unto to the ending of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.00,2:14:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵的时代…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time of the Elves...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.04,2:14:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,…已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:28.80,2:14:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该让中土世界自生自灭？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we leave Middle-earth to its fate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.32,2:14:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,或是让他们孤军奋战吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we let them stand alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.20,2:14:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么消息？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.76,2:14:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的探子报告，萨鲁曼向洛汗国进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our scouts report Saruman has attacked Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.72,2:14:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿率领人民逃到圣盔谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoden's people have fled to Helm's Deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.76,2:14:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须守住边境，法拉墨，半兽人在蠢蠢欲动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we must look to our own borders. Faramir, Orcs are on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:53.92,2:14:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦在召募大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron is marshaling an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.68,2:14:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,野人部落和南蛮族聚集在黑门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easterlings and Southrons are at the Black Gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.96,2:15:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有多少？ - 几千人，每天都增加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many? - Some thousands. More come every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.48,2:15:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁驻守在北边河流？ - 奥斯吉力亚斯的五百名精兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's covering the river to the north? - We pulled 500 men at Osgiliath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:07.24,2:15:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要是受到攻击绝对抵档不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If their city is attacked, we won't hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.40,2:15:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼从艾辛格发动攻势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman attacks from Isengard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.80,2:15:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦则从魔多进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron from Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.80,2:15:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,人类将受到两面夹攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fight will come to Men on both fronts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.16,2:15:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎势单力薄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gondor is weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.04,2:15:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦很快就会打过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron will strike us soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.92,2:15:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他会全力进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he will strike hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.20,2:15:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道我们现在无力抵档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows now we do not have the strength to repel him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:48.24,2:15:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手下说你们是半兽人间谍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My men tell me that you are Orc spies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.64,2:15:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,间谍？有没有搞错？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spies? Now wait just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.52,2:15:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不是间谍是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you're not spies, then who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.68,2:16:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.52,2:16:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是夏尔来的哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are Hobbits of the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:08.48,2:16:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是佛罗多巴金斯，这是山姆卫斯詹吉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo Baggins is my name, and this is Samwise Gamgee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.88,2:16:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你的保镖吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your bodyguard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.60,2:16:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他的园丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His gardener.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.00,2:16:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你们那个鬼鬼祟祟的朋友呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where is your skulking friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.52,2:16:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,滑不溜丢的小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That gangrel creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.16,2:16:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那个丑八怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had an ill-favored look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:25.84,2:16:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没有别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.88,2:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟七个同伴从端文戴尔出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We set out from Rivendell with seven companions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.52,2:16:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在摩瑞亚失去一名同伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One we lost in Moria...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.68,2:16:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,其中有两个也是哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two were my kin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.36,2:16:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个矮人、一个精灵和两个人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a Dwarf there was also. And an Elf and two Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.24,2:16:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉松之子亚拉冈和刚铎人波罗莫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn, son of Arathorn, and Boromir of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.16,2:16:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你是波罗莫的朋友？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a friend of Boromir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.40,2:17:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.92,2:17:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我是这么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For my part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.56,2:17:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你知道他死了，一定会很难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will grieve you then to learn that he is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.52,2:17:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,死了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.16,2:17:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会？几时？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How? When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.44,2:17:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你是他的同伴，我倒希望你能告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As one of his companions, I'd hoped you would tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.40,2:17:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果波罗莫出了事，我希望你能告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If something has happened to Boromir, we would have you tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.00,2:17:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,六天前他的号角被冲到河岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His horn washed up upon the riverbank, about six days past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.68,2:17:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,号角被砍成两半{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was cloven in two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.44,2:17:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我很清楚他已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But more than this, I know it in my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:45.88,2:17:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的兄长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:36.56,2:18:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,波罗莫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boromir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.16,2:18:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,波罗莫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boromir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.24,2:18:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城市曾是我们王国的骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This city was once the jewel of our kingdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.16,2:18:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,充满光明、美和音乐的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A place of light and beauty and music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.00,2:18:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,它将恢复它的辉煌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so it shall be once more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.88,2:19:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我要告诉魔多的邪恶大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the armies of Mordor know this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.72,2:19:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们人民的土地将不再落入敌人手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never again will the land of my people fall into enemy hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.88,2:19:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯吉力亚斯城又重回刚铎人民怀抱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This city of Osgiliath has been reclaimed for Gondor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.96,2:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刚铎万岁 - 刚铎万岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For Gondor! - For Gondor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.64,2:19:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很棒的演讲，简单扼要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good speech. Nice and short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.56,2:19:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才有更多时间喝酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaves more time for drinking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:35.76,2:19:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出啤酒，弟兄们口渴了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break out the ale! These men are thirsty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.48,2:19:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,小弟，记住今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember today, little brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.80,2:19:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,今天很美好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, life is good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.96,2:19:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:54.92,2:19:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.60,2:20:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他不能让我们清静一下吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One moment of peace, can he not give us that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.60,2:20:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.84,2:20:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎最英勇的战士在哪里？我的长子在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Gondor's finest? Where's my first-born?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.84,2:20:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.40,2:20:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说你几乎是一夫当关，亲手把所有敌人歼灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say you vanquished the enemy almost single-handedly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:15.92,2:20:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那是夸大其词，胜利也属于法拉墨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They exaggerate. The victory belongs to Faramir also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:20.80,2:20:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是他，这座城市就不会被毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for Faramir, this city would still be standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.52,2:20:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是命令你保护这座城吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you not entrusted to protect it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.96,2:20:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我誓死保护它，但是我们寡不敌众{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have done, but our numbers were too few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.20,2:20:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是藉口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, too few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.40,2:20:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你让敌人直驱而入，就这样把城攻下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let the enemy walk in and take it on a whim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.00,2:20:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你老是丢我的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always you cast a poor reflection on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:39.24,2:20:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是故意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not my intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:41.64,2:20:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他拼了命为你奋战，你却不给他一点肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give him no credit, and yet he tries to do your will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:48.80,2:20:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他很敬爱你 - 别替法拉墨说好话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He loves you, Father. - Do not trouble me with Faramir...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.88,2:20:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他一点都没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know his uses, and they are few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.80,2:20:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有更要紧的事要谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have more urgent things to speak of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.60,2:21:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞文戴尔的爱隆王召集会议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elrond of Rivendell has called a meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:02.16,2:21:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他没说原因，但是我也猜得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will not say why, but I have guessed its purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.20,2:21:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,传言敌人的利器被找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is rumored that the weapon of the enemy has been found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:11.24,2:21:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The One Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.28,2:21:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 埃西铎的魔戒 - 它落入精灵的手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isildur's Bane. - It has fallen into the hands of the Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.12,2:21:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都想争夺它，人类、矮人、巫师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone will try to claim it: Men, Dwarves, wizards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.92,2:21:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须阻止他们，刚铎一定要得到至尊魔戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot let that happen. This thing must come to Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.84,2:21:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刚铎 - 很危险，我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gondor. - It's dangerous, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.68,2:21:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,意志不坚定的人会受到魔戒蛊惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever the Ring will seek to corrupt the hearts of lesser Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.56,2:21:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你很坚强，我们急迫需要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you, you are strong. And our need is great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.68,2:21:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为了捍卫中土世界抛头颅洒热血，牺牲无数人命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is our blood which is being spilled, our people who are dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:47.16,2:21:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦的时间充裕，他正在集结邪恶大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron is biding his time. He's massing fresh armies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.40,2:21:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会再回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:54.04,2:21:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我们就无力才氐档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when he does, we will be powerless to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.96,2:22:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:01.68,2:22:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个强大的礼物带回来给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me back this mighty gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.64,2:22:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我要跟人民并肩作战，我不要去瑞文戴尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. My place is here with my people. Not in Rivendell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:10.32,2:22:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你连自己父亲的话都不听？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you deny your own father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.17,2:22:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要派人去瑞文戴尔…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is need to go to Rivendell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.20,2:22:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就派我去吧 - 你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- send me in his stead. - You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.32,2:22:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.40,2:22:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎将军法拉墨想要证明他的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chance for Faramir, captain of Gondor, to show his quality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.04,2:22:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.20,2:22:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你兄长能完成这项任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust this mission only to your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.28,2:22:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他绝对不会让我失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one who will not fail me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:50.32,2:22:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,小弟，你要记住今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember today, little brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:11.84,2:23:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉墨将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Faramir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.08,2:23:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到另一个家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found the third one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:28.72,2:23:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我走，来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must come with me. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:41.96,2:23:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,下面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:57.96,2:24:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谁敢闯进禁忌之池格杀勿论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To enter the Forbidden Pool bears the penalty of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.48,2:24:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在等我的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wait for my command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.44,2:24:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我该下令吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I shoot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:20.80,2:24:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,池塘的水好清凉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rock and pool Is nice and cool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:24.00,2:24:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,池塘的鱼好甘甜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So juicy sweet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.48,2:24:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一的愿望就是抓到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our only wish To catch a fish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:29.60,2:24:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,甘甜的鱼儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So juicy sweet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:39.32,2:24:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.20,2:24:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这个生物对我有义务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This creature is bound to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:45.64,2:24:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我对他也有责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:50.84,2:24:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们的向导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is our guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.88,2:24:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:58.44,2:25:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,让我下去找他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let me go down to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:11.60,2:25:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:14.24,2:25:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,主人在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.72,2:25:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,来，史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.72,2:25:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,相信主人，来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust master. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:27.52,2:25:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要走吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must go now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.72,2:25:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈，你要相信主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol, you must trust master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:35.32,2:25:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:37.92,2:25:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,来呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:42.04,2:25:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来，史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.76,2:25:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈乖，很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice Smeagol. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.28,2:25:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,来呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:52.24,2:25:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别伤害他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.08,2:25:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别挣扎，听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol, don't struggle. Smeagol, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.96,2:25:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:23.44,2:26:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.44,2:26:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你要带他们去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you taking them

?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.48,2:26:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,快回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:35.92,2:26:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.60,2:26:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要哭，史麦戈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does it cry, Smeagol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:48.60,2:26:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,坏人伤害我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cruel Men hurts us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:51.40,2:26:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,主人骗了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master tricksed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.56,2:26:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他当然骗了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:58.48,2:27:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我就跟你说他很奸诈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you he was tricksy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.36,2:27:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说他很虚伪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you he was false.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:05.56,2:27:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,主人是朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master is our friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:08.44,2:27:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:11.00,2:27:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,主人出卖了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master betrayed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:13.32,2:27:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这不关你事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not its business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:17.40,2:27:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别管我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:20.00,2:27:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,臭哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Filthy little Hobbitses!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:22.56,2:27:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们偷走我们的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They stole it from us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:25.00,2:27:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:27.00,2:27:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们偷走什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they steal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:30.80,2:27:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My precious!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:39.88,2:27:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要逃走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.08,2:27:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go. Go, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:46.68,2:27:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以逃走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:49.96,2:27:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快用魔戒，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use the Ring, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:51.60,2:27:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just this once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:53.56,2:27:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,戴上它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:55.76,2:27:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,消失不见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.84,2:27:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:03.00,2:28:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:06.68,2:28:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你试着告诉我，但是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tried to tell me but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:13.88,2:28:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:20.56,2:28:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒控制了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring's taking me, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:24.88,2:28:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我一戴上魔戒…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I put it on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:26.72,2:28:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,…他就会找到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'll find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.72,2:28:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他就会看到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.92,2:28:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:40.80,2:28:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,原来这就是所有谜团的解答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is the answer to all the riddles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:47.28,2:28:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我在荒郊野外找到你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here in the Wild I have you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:50.44,2:28:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,两个半身人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two Halflings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:52.52,2:28:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一群忠心的部下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a host of men at my call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.00,2:29:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒也垂手可得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring of Power within my grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:12.16,2:29:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我这刚铎大将法拉墨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chance for Faramir, captain of Gondor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:17.52,2:29:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,将证明自己的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to show his quality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:41.64,2:29:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.44,2:29:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:47.96,2:29:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,放了他吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:50.32,2:29:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:54.16,2:29:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定要摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got to destroy it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:56.20,2:29:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们才要去魔多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where we're going, into Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.64,2:30:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,把它丢进末日火山烈焰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the Mountain of Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:02.32,2:30:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯吉力亚斯受到攻击，他们请你调派援兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Osgiliath is under attack. They call for reinforcements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:05.64,2:30:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你，他身负重担{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. It's such a burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:10.80,2:30:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你不肯帮他吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you not help him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:14.24,2:30:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,将军？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:16.80,2:30:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,准备出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:24.00,2:30:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒将被带到刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring will go to Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.44,2:31:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他还活着 - 他人呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's alive! - Where is he? Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:42.24,2:31:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让开，我要宰了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way! I'm going to kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:45.44,2:31:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我见过最幸运、最机智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the luckiest, the canniest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:49.40,2:31:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也是最不怕死的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the most reckless man I ever knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:54.12,2:31:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bless you, laddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:56.16,2:31:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,金灵，国王呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimli, where is the king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:06.96,2:32:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你迟到了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:11.68,2:32:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来好惨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:54.76,2:32:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一支大军？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A great host, you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:57.00,2:32:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾辛格大军倾巢而出 - 多少人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All Isengard is emptied. - How many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:00.36,2:33:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,至少有一万人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten thousand strong at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:04.84,2:33:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一万人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten thousand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:06.72,2:33:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这支大军只有一个目的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is an army bred for a single purpose:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:11.92,2:33:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁人类世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To destroy the world of Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:16.52,2:33:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们入夜就会攻到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will be here by nightfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:24.36,2:33:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:27.20,2:33:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,让每个士兵和壮丁佩带武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want every man and strong lad able to bear arms...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:30.12,2:33:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚准备迎敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be ready for battle by nightfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:41.52,2:33:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在上面守住通道和城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will cover the causeway and the gate from above.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:44.60,2:33:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人攻得下深溪墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No army has ever breached the Deeping Wall...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:47.24,2:33:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,或是攻进号角堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or set foot inside the Hornburg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:50.12,2:33:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这些可不是低能的半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no rabble of mindless Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:53.12,2:33:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是强兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are Uruk-hai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:55.48,2:33:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,骁勇善战、武器精良{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their armor is thick and their shields broad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:00.56,2:34:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我身经百战，矮人先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have fought many wars, Master Dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:04.40,2:34:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么防卫我的堡垒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how to defend my own keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:14.60,2:34:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这座碉堡可以说是滴水不漏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will break upon this fortress like water on rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:18.16,2:34:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼大军会烧杀掳掠，这种事我常见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman's hordes will pillage and burn. We've seen it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:23.60,2:34:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但是农作物可以再耕种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crops can be resown...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:26.44,2:34:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,家园可以再重建{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}homes rebuilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.08,2:34:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这座铜墙铁壁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Within these walls...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:33.00,2:34:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,撑得绝对比他们久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will outlast them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:34.64,2:34:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是来烧杀掳掠的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They do not come to destroy Rohan's crops or villages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:37.24,2:34:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是来把洛汗人赶尽杀绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They come to destroy its people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:38.96,2:34:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,连一个小孩也不放过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}down to the last child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.32,2:34:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you have me do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.80,2:34:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at my men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:46.68,2:34:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就快失去勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their courage hangs by a thread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:50.64,2:34:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们非死不可，我也要他们奋战到底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is to be our end, then I would have them make such an end...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.16,2:34:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好让世人永远记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as to be worthy of remembrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:01.84,2:35:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,派出骑士，王上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send out riders, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:04.04,2:35:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要去搬救兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must call for aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:10.20,2:35:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会来救我们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who will come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:12.84,2:35:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:14.64,2:35:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dwarves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:17.48,2:35:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不像你有那么多朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not so lucky in our friends as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:21.16,2:35:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,古老的同盟早已瓦解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old alliances are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:23.88,2:35:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刚铎会派出救兵 - 刚铎？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gondor will answer. - Gondor?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:26.84,2:35:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,西谷沦陷时他们在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was Gondor when the Westfold fell?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:30.00,2:35:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被敌人围攻时，他们在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was Gondor when our enemies closed in around us?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:33.40,2:35:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was Gon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:38.00,2:35:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不，亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my Lord Aragorn...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:41.56,2:35:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能孤军奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:50.88,2:35:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把女人小孩带进洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the women and children into the caves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:52.80,2:35:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要时间准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more time to lay provisions...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:54.24,2:35:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了，开战了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no time. War is upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:58.04,2:35:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁大门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secure the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:04.92,2:36:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们树人不插手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We Ents have not troubled...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:07.20,2:36:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,人类和巫师的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the wars of Men and wizards...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:11.36,2:36:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有好久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a very long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:15.60,2:36:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在要发生的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now, something is about to happen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:20.56,2:36:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也有好长一段时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that has not happened...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:23.04,2:36:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没有发生过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for an age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:26.72,2:36:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,树人会议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Entmoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:29.44,2:36:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:30.84,2:36:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一种集会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Tis a gathering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:34.88,2:36:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么的集会？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gathering of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:55.36,2:36:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,山毛桦、橡树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beech. Oak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:57.92,2:36:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,朵树、白杨树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chestnut. Ash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:00.08,2:37:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Good. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:02.20,2:37:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很多树人都来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many have come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:12.12,2:37:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须决定树人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we must decide if the Ents...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:15.08,2:37:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,该不该参战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will go to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:26.56,2:37:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退，快进洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move back! Move to the caves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:32.12,2:37:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙儿，快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, people! Quickly, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:34.60,2:37:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把物资堆在墙边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll place the reserves along the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:37.04,2:37:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,它们可以用来支撑拱门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can support the archers from above the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:39.52,2:37:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈，你一定要休息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn, you must rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:42.80,2:37:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你半死不活的没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're no use to us half alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:45.68,2:37:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:50.32,2:37:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要带老弱妇孺躲进山洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm to be sent with the women into the caves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:53.48,2:37:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是很重要的任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is an honorable charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:55.32,2:37:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你要照顾小孩，士兵回来替他们准备食粮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To mind the children, to find food and bedding when the men return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:58.36,2:38:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那有什么值得骄仿的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What renown is there in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:00.24,2:38:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,以后还会有需要你挺身而出的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lady, a time may come for valor without renown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:04.20,2:38:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,当敌人攻破最后防线，你的人民该听谁的指挥？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who then will your people look to in the last defense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:07.16,2:38:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我和你并肩作战 - 我没有权力下这个命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me stand at your side. - It is not in my power to command it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:12.48,2:38:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必下令他们就肯留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not command the others to stay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:15.44,2:38:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不愿离开你，所以才跟你并肩作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They fight beside you because they would not be parted from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:20.36,2:38:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because they love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:29.68,2:38:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:37.12,2:39:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,农夫、蹄铁匠、马僮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farmers, farriers, stable boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:41.48,2:39:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人都不是士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are no soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:45.60,2:39:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大多数都太老了 - 或是太年轻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Most have seen too many winters. - Or too few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:52.96,2:39:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看看他们，他们被吓坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at them. They're frightened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:56.04,2:39:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,从他们的眼神就看得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see it in their eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:02.76,2:40:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:04.92,2:40:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只有三百人，却要对抗一万大军{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:09.76,2:40:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里总比留在伊多拉斯来得安全{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:13.44,2:40:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们毫无胜算{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:17.00,2:40:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们全都会丧命{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:18.44,2:40:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我也要跟着一起死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I shall die as one of them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:27.12,2:40:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,让他去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go, lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:29.52,2:40:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,让他去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:32.96,2:40:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,会使剑的人都去领武器了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every villager able to wield a sword has been sent to the armory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:42.68,2:40:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,王上？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:46.64,2:40:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,加姆林，我是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I, Gamling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:52.60,2:40:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,您是我们的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are our king, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:59.48,2:41:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信你的国王吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do you trust your king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:04.32,2:41:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,王上，无论死活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your men, my lord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:07.68,2:41:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,您的士兵都将追随您奋战到底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will follow you to whatever end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:17.36,2:41:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,无论死活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To whatever end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:29.08,2:41:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,剽悍的战马和骑士在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the horse and the rider?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:32.80,2:41:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利的号角在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the horn that was blowing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:37.36,2:41:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它们就像落在高山的雨滴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have passed like rain on the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:42.84,2:41:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,或是佛过草原的微风早就消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like wind in the meadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:49.72,2:41:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,昔日的荣耀就像太阳西下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The days have gone down in the West...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:54.20,2:41:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,黯然消失在山后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behind the hills...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:58.72,2:42:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,被黑暗笼罩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into Shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:08.80,2:42:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会变成这样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did it come to this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:33.56,2:42:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,过了好几个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been going for hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:36.56,2:42:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们早就应该做了决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have decided something by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:39.12,2:42:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,决定？才没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decided? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:43.44,2:42:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才刚向大家…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only just finished saying...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:49.76,2:42:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,…道完早安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:52.96,2:42:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可是现在已经是晚上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's nighttime already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:56.32,2:42:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么这么慢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't take forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:59.12,2:43:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别心急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be hasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:01.60,2:43:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're running out of time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:07.12,2:43:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快走，快到外墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move to the outer wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:27.56,2:43:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,把剑给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:38.36,2:43:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:40.12,2:43:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哈拉斯，哈玛之子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haleth, son of Hama, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:44.60,2:43:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都说我们活不过今晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The men are saying we will not live out the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:43:49.20,2:43:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都说没有希望了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say that it is hopeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:09.00,2:44:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是把好剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a good sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:12.68,2:44:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哈玛之子哈拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haleth, son of Hama...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:19.36,2:44:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,永远都有希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is always hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:44.48,2:44:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直都相信你，你也没让我们失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have trusted you this far. You have not led us astray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:48.00,2:44:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:49.72,2:44:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该绝望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong to despair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:54.40,2:44:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么好原谅的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:00.40,2:45:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还有时间，我得改改这身锁子甲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had time, I'd get this adjusted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:06.60,2:45:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,胸口这边有点紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a little tight across the chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:14.88,2:45:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是半兽人的号角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is no Orc horn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:22.52,2:45:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快去叫国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send for the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:24.52,2:45:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打开城门 - 开城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Open the gate! - Open up the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:59.80,2:46:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is this possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:02.48,2:46:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我带来瑞文戴尔爱隆王的信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bring word from Elrond of Rivendell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:06.24,2:46:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵和人类曾经结为同盟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An alliance once existed between Elves and Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:10.16,2:46:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在很久以前曾经并肩作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long ago we fought and died together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:16.68,2:46:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要来帮助你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We come to honor that allegiance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:28.08,2:46:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are most welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:46:35.36,2:46:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很荣幸再跟人类并肩作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are proud to fight alongside Men once more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:12.96,2:47:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你挑的什么烂位置嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have picked a better spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:21.08,2:47:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你的运气有多好，都希望你能撑过今晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, lad, whatever luck you live by, let's hope it lasts the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:31.44,2:47:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友都在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friends are with you, Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:33.88,2:47:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,希望他们熬得过今晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hope they last the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:36.32,2:48:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别对敌人心存怜悯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:41.08,2:48:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们不会手下留情{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:17.84,2:49:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 外面发生什么事？ - 你要我形容给你听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's happening out there? - Shall I describe it to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:21.88,2:49:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还是替你找垫脚箱？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or would you like me to find you a box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:03.08,2:50:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:26.88,2:50:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,开战了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:34.56,2:50:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,准备发射{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:44.76,2:50:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的盔甲有罩门{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:47.12,2:50:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,脖子和手腕{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:48.80,2:50:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,放箭{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:55.56,2:50:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有射中？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they hit anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:57.60,2:50:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,连珠箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give them a volley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:59.76,2:51:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 射箭！ - 射箭！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fire! - Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:17.56,2:51:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们送来领死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send them to me! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:38.84,2:51:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,梯子！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:40.00,2:51:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:47.88,2:51:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,迎敌！迎敌！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swords! Swords!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:28.96,2:52:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,勒苟拉斯，我痛宰了两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas! Two already!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:31.28,2:52:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了十七个了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on 17!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:33.56,2:52:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让尖耳朵赢过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have no pointy-ear outscoring me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:42.96,2:52:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,十九个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nineteen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:10.64,2:53:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:16.48,2:53:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们同意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have just agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:30.28,2:53:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,同意什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:33.24,2:53:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我在树人会议上提到你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have told your names to the Entmoot...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:38.60,2:53:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we have agreed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:42.24,2:53:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不是半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are not Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:48.04,2:53:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是好消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:50.36,2:53:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼呢？你们对他有什么决定？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about Saruman? Have you come to a decision about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:55.12,2:53:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别急，梅里雅达克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, don't be hasty, Master Meriadoc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:59.12,2:54:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别急？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hasty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:01.40,2:54:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的朋友在打仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our friends are out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:03.44,2:54:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要帮忙，他们不能孤军奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need our help. They cannot fight this war on their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:07.96,2:54:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,打仗？没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War? Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:10.40,2:54:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,战争是影响了大家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It affects us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:12.44,2:54:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,包括树木、树根和树枝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tree, root and twig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:16.32,2:54:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你要了解，小哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you must understand, young Hobbit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:20.60,2:54:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,用古树人语说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it takes a long time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:22.68,2:54:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要花很长的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to say anything in Old Entish...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:27.76,2:54:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从来都不说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we never say anything...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:32.12,2:54:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,除非是要花很长的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless it is worth taking...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:36.24,2:54:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,才能说完的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a long time to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:41.08,2:54:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,十七、十八{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventeen! Eighteen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:44.52,2:54:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,十九{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nineteen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:46.16,2:54:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,二十{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:48.20,2:54:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,二十一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:59.96,2:55:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快射箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Causeway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:09.72,2:55:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:12.28,2:55:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你就只有这点能耐吗，萨鲁曼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this is all you can conjure, Saruman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:41.60,2:55:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快把他射倒{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:46.32,2:55:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:41.20,2:56:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,档住城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:00.88,2:57:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,档住他们，死守住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold them! Stand firm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:11.00,2:57:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:16.96,2:57:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,金灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimli!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:28.80,2:57:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:06.92,2:58:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,树人无法力挽狂澜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ents cannot hold back this storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:11.64,2:58:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能像以前一样逆来顺受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must weather such things as we have always done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:16.48,2:58:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么能这么决定？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can that be your decision?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:19.24,2:58:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not our war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:23.20,2:58:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你们也属于这世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're part of this world!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:29.56,2:58:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:35.44,2:58:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must help. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:39.08,2:58:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要想想办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:42.12,2:58:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里，你很年轻也很勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are young and brave, Master Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:47.64,2:58:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你的旅程已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your part in this tale is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:51.56,2:58:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,回去你的家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to your home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:03.80,2:59:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也许树须说的对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Treebeard's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:06.24,2:59:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也无能为力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't belong here, Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:08.24,2:59:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们太渺小了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too big for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:10.72,2:59:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能做什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can we do in the end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:15.68,2:59:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有夏尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:18.84,2:59:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们应该回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:23.24,2:59:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,艾辛格的战火会蔓延{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fires of Isengard will spread...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:26.60,2:59:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,塔克镇和雄鹿地树林也会燃烧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the woods of Tuckborough and Buckland will burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:31.68,2:59:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,最后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:35.12,2:59:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大自然和善良老百姓都会消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all that was once green and good in this world will be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:59:41.68,2:59:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,夏尔也会毁于一旦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There won't be a Shire, Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:04.12,3:00:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:05.56,3:00:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退到圣盔谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back to the Keep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:08.08,3:00:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,叫他们撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your men out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:12.32,3:00:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,退到圣盔谷{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:18.64,3:00:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退到圣盔谷{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:20.84,3:00:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哈尔达！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haldir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:23.28,3:00:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,退到圣盔谷{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:26.60,3:00:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干嘛停下来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? What are you stopping for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:49.08,3:00:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哈尔达！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haldir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:33.00,3:01:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,档住城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:36.72,3:01:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快挡住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:39.88,3:01:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,赶到大门，快拔剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the gate. Draw your swords!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:11.40,3:02:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:16.24,3:02:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们抵档不了多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot hold much longer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:23.96,3:02:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 档住他们 - 你要多久？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold them! - How long do you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:27.64,3:02:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们能撑多久就多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as you can give me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:30.40,3:02:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,金灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimli!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:33.52,3:02:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,用木头档住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timbers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:35.08,3:02:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,档住城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:51.80,3:02:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，我们能干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We can take them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:54.36,3:02:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太远了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:01.24,3:03:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,把我丢过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:04.16,3:03:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 我跳不过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I cannot jump the distance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:06.16,3:03:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,把我丢过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to toss me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:13.32,3:03:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟精灵小子说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell the Elf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:15.16,3:03:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我会守口如瓶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:32.16,3:03:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shore up the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:33.76,3:03:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让开 - 跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make way! - Follow me to the barricade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:36.00,3:03:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch our backs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:41.24,3:03:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这儿再来一根 - 高一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Throw another one over here! - Higher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:33.40,3:04:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快撑住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold fast the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:39.08,3:04:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,金灵、亚拉冈，快走！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimli! Aragorn! Get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:46.76,3:04:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:21.80,3:05:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,叫大家撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull everybody back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:24.60,3:05:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,叫他们回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:26.92,3:05:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,撒退！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:32.20,3:05:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们攻进来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have broken through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:34.08,3:05:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,城门被攻陷，快撒退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The castle is breached. Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:36.52,3:05:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 撒退 - 撒退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fall back! - Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:38.92,3:05:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快把他们带进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry! Inside. Get them inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:41.68,3:05:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,进去碉堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into the Keep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:55.40,3:06:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你们带到森林西边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will leave you at the western borders of the forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:00.52,3:06:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们往北走就可以回到家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can make your way north to your homeland from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:11.00,3:06:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:13.16,3:06:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:17.76,3:06:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,转回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:20.40,3:06:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 掉头回去，带我们到南边 - 南边？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Turn around. Take us south. - South?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:23.28,3:06:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是去艾辛格的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that will lead you past Isengard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:28.60,3:06:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:31.48,3:06:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以悄悄越过萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we go south, we can slip past Saruman unnoticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:34.88,3:06:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,越危险的地方越安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The closer we are to danger, the farther we are from harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:37.68,3:06:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定料想不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the last thing he'll expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:42.32,3:06:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这没有道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't make sense to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:45.52,3:06:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不过…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:46.88,3:06:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,…你们的个子是很小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are very small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:50.04,3:06:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你说的对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:54.44,3:06:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那就往南吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South it is, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:57.48,3:07:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了，小哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, little Shirelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:02.84,3:07:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我一向都喜欢往南走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always like going south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:05.76,3:07:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像下坡一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow it feels like going downhill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:10.68,3:07:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯啦？我们会被逮到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you mad? We'll be caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:13.32,3:07:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,才不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:16.00,3:07:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:24.92,3:07:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:27.60,3:07:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯吉力亚斯在燃烧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Osgiliath burns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:30.16,3:07:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,魔多大军攻来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mordor has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:32.76,3:07:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒也救不了刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring will not save Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:36.48,3:07:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,它只有毁灭的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has only the power to destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:39.60,3:07:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:41.16,3:07:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,让我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:43.84,3:07:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:48.92,3:07:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉墨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faramir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:50.48,3:07:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要让我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:53.44,3:07:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那一家子的小田鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And those little family of field mice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:57.04,3:07:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,爬到我身上把我弄得好痒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that climb up sometimes, and they tickle me awfully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:00.60,3:08:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们老是爬到…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're always trying to get somewhere where they...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:15.08,3:08:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这些树有很多是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many of these trees were my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:18.72,3:08:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还是种子我就认识他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creatures I had known from nut and acorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:24.52,3:08:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾，树须{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Treebeard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:25.88,3:08:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有自己的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had voices of their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:30.88,3:08:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:33.80,3:08:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一个巫师不该这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A wizard should know better!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:51.16,3:08:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是精灵语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no curse in Elvish...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:55.00,3:08:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,树人语或是人类的语言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Entish or the tongues of Men...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:57.84,3:09:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,都没有更强烈的字眼来诅咒他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for this treachery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:01.56,3:09:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你看，那些树在移动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! The trees! They're moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:09.08,3:09:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:10.84,3:09:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要去对付半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have business with the Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:14.52,3:09:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我今晚要用巨石和岩石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My business is with Isengard tonight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:19.00,3:09:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁艾辛格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with rock and stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:45.56,3:09:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:47.76,3:09:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，朋友们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:50.56,3:09:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,树人要开战了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ents are going to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:54.88,3:09:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很可能…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is likely...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:56.84,3:10:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,…会走向灭亡之路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we go to our doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:01.76,3:10:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是树人…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last march...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:04.76,3:10:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,…最后的一役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the Ents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:54.96,3:10:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,半兽人占领了东岸，他们的数量太多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faramir! Orcs have taken the eastern shore. Their numbers are too great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:58.84,3:11:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,到晚上我们就会溃不成军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By nightfall we will be overrun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:03.68,3:11:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:05.48,3:11:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,它在召唤他，邪眼就快看到我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's calling to him, Sam. His Eye is almost on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:09.72,3:11:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,撑着点，你不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Mr. Frodo. You'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:26.52,3:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,把他带去见我父王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them to my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:29.48,3:11:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就说法拉墨送上大礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him Faramir sends a mighty gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:34.92,3:11:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一个足以扭转局势的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A weapon that will change our fortunes in this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:39.12,3:11:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你想知道波罗莫的下场吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to know what happened to Boromir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:42.48,3:11:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你想知道你的兄长为什么会死吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know why your brother died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:45.72,3:11:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一派胡言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to take the Ring from Frodo after swearing an oath to protect him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:49.64,3:11:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他想杀死他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:51.68,3:11:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒把你的兄长逼疯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring drove your brother mad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:54.80,3:11:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:07.56,3:12:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:11.36,3:12:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:16.28,3:12:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:21.32,3:12:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,戒灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nazgul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:45.36,3:12:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,待在这儿，躲起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here. Keep out of sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:49.32,3:12:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快找掩护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:08.88,3:13:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,堡垒被攻陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fortress is taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:11.20,3:13:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们输了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:12.60,3:13:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你说这座堡垒绝不会沦陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said this fortress would never fall while your men defend it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:16.68,3:13:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会奋战到底，直到死为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They still defend it. They have died defending it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:22.36,3:13:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们攻进来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're breaking in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:26.40,3:13:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们攻进城门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're past the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:32.24,3:13:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,洞穴里的女人小孩没办法逃出去吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there no other way for the women and children to get out of the caves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:39.04,3:13:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没别的路了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there no other way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:42.52,3:13:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有一条通道直接通到山上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one passage. It leads into the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:46.28,3:13:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他们逃不远，到处都有强兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they will not get far. The Uruk-hai are too many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:53.36,3:13:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,叫女人小孩进入通道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the women and children to make for the mountain pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:55.92,3:13:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 堵住入口 - 死了这么多人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And barricade the entrance! - So much death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:00.96,3:14:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,人类该如何对抗这种仇恨？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can Men do against such reckless hate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:09.04,3:14:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起冲出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride out with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:14.56,3:14:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,冲出去迎敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride out and meet them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:17.00,3:14:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,为了光荣的牺牲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For death and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:19.32,3:14:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,为了洛汗国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:22.20,3:14:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你的人民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:24.40,3:14:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sun is rising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:30.84,3:14:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,五天后等待我的出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look to my coming at first light on the fifth day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:34.00,3:14:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,破晓时…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At dawn...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:35.60,3:14:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,…向东方看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}look to the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:41.52,3:14:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:45.60,3:14:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:48.60,3:14:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,圣盔鎚手的号角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The horn of Helm Hammerhand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:51.20,3:14:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,将在圣盔谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shall sound in the Deep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:54.40,3:14:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次响起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:56.56,3:14:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:01.12,3:15:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们一起拔剑抗敌的时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let this be the hour when we draw swords together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:12.72,3:15:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,邪恶兵团，领死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fell deeds, awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:15.20,3:15:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我要以满腔热血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now for wrath...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:16.52,3:15:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,和无比勇气迎接浴血黎明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now for ruin and a red dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:26.92,3:15:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,骠骑勇士，冲啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forth Eorlingas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:17.00,3:16:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:25.48,3:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿王孤军奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoden King stands alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:29.80,3:16:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他并不孤单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:32.32,3:16:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗弟兄们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rohirrim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:39.40,3:16:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧墨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eomer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:40.72,3:16:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救国王！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:00.88,3:18:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:11.76,3:18:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,丢得好，好准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hit. A fine hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:39.76,3:18:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,撞破水坝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break the dam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:42.44,3:18:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让河水泄洪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release the river!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:13.16,3:19:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘，抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin! Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:21.16,3:19:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了，小哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, little Hobbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:05.48,3:20:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:16.04,3:20:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:15.80,3:21:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是我呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:19.64,3:21:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:26.16,3:21:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不认得我了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know your Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:46.52,3:21:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我办不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do this, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:50.76,3:21:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:53.76,3:21:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这不公平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:56.92,3:21:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本来就不该来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By rights, we shouldn't even be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:06.32,3:22:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:14.84,3:22:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像我们听过的精采故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like in the great stories, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:18.04,3:22:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,歌颂伟大的事迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones that really mattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:21.48,3:22:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,充满了黑暗和危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full of darkness and danger they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:24.64,3:22:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候你不想知道结局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sometimes you didn't want to know the end...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:27.80,3:22:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,因为怎么可能有快乐结局？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because how could the end be happy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:33.32,3:22:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,发生这么多可怕的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could the world go back to the way it was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:35.64,3:22:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界怎么可能回到从前？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when so much bad had happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:40.00,3:22:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:42.08,3:22:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们获胜了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:43.84,3:22:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但是最后可怕的阴影…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in the end, it's only a passing thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:47.92,3:22:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,…终究会消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:49.40,3:22:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就连黑暗也会消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even darkness must pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:52.00,3:22:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,崭新的一天将会来临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new day will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:54.84,3:22:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳也会散发更明亮的光芒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when the sun shines, it will shine out the clearer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:00.72,3:23:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是让人永生难忘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were the stories that stayed with you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:03.28,3:23:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,意义非凡的成人故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that meant something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:05.20,3:23:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,纵使你太年轻不明白为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if you were too small to understand why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:09.16,3:23:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我想我明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think, Mr. Frodo, I do understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:13.20,3:23:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:15.56,3:23:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这些故事里的主角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Folk in those stories...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:17.96,3:23:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多机会半途而废，但是他们并没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had lots of chances of turning back, only they didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:22.24,3:23:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们决定勇往直前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They kept going...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:25.16,3:23:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们抱着一种信念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because they were holding on to something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:30.04,3:23:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们抱着什么信念？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we holding on to, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:44.28,3:23:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上一定存在着善良{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That there's some good in this world, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:48.48,3:23:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,值得我们奋战到底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's worth fighting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:18.00,3:24:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于了解你的伟大使命，佛罗多巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think at last we understand one another, Frodo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:23.04,3:24:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚我国的法律，你父王的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the laws of our country, the laws of your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:27.20,3:24:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你把他们放走，就会被处死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you let them go, your life will be forfeit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:33.76,3:24:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我宁愿死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it is forfeit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:37.92,3:24:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,放了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:51.76,3:24:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别进去树林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay out of the forest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:53.96,3:24:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,离那些树远一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep away from the trees!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:25:46.60,3:25:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,最后的战绩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Final count...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:25:48.56,3:25:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四十二 - 四十二？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 42. - 42?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:25:52.92,3:25:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对你这尖耳朵的精灵小子来说已经算是不错的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not bad for a pointy-eared Elvish princeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:25:58.52,3:26:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我比你多一个，四十三个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I myself am sitting pretty on 43.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:06.28,3:26:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四十三 - 他早就挂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 43. - He was already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:10.36,3:26:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在动 - 他会动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was twitching. - He was twitching...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:13.04,3:26:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我的斧头还插在他的脑袋上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he's got my ax embedded in his nervous system!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:19.92,3:26:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他好像不是很高兴，对吧？ - 他一点都不高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He doesn't look too happy, does he? - Not too happy at all, Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:24.88,3:26:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我猜，那上面的风景应该不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still, I suppose the view would be quite nice from up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:28.60,3:26:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，这地方很高级哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. It's a quality establishment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:31.72,3:26:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听说服务也不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear the staff are very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:40.24,3:26:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？ - 没干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:42.76,3:26:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 切都恢复正常了 - 才没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The world's back to normal, that's all. - No, it isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:47.24,3:26:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我饿扁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:48.60,3:26:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这鬼地方哪有好东西可以吃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck trying to find something decent around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:51.92,3:26:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大概只有死老鼠跟发霉面包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably dead rats and moldy bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:18.92,3:27:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼的储藏室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman's storeroom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:22.48,3:27:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(夏尔南区)
Dialogue: 0,3:27:23.64,3:27:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:26.56,3:27:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:29.24,3:27:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是耶 - 长底烟草{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is! - Longbottom Leaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:33.44,3:27:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,夏尔南区最上等的烟草{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The finest pipe-weed in South Farthing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:36.12,3:27:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了，一人一桶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's perfect. One barrel each.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:39.36,3:27:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:41.24,3:27:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要不要分点给树须抽？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think we should share it with Treebeard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:42.64,3:27:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,分给他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Share it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:46.00,3:27:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,万万不得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:49.92,3:27:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是死的植物耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead plant and all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:51.68,3:27:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会很不爽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think he'd understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:55.16,3:27:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不好这是他的远亲咧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be a distant relative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:58.12,3:28:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我了了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:00.80,3:28:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别心急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be hasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:04.68,3:28:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:07.52,3:28:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bar-hrum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:35.44,3:28:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是旧的排水道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the old sewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:36.88,3:28:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,从河底一直通到城外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Runs right under the river through to the edge of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:40.20,3:28:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,尽头就是一片树林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find cover in the woods there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:43.04,3:28:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉墨将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Faramir...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:46.12,3:28:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你证明了自己的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have shown your quality, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:50.44,3:28:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,和最高尚的品德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The very highest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:52.24,3:28:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,夏尔一定是一个好地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Shire must truly be a great realm, Master Gamgee...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:55.04,3:28:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,连一个园丁都这么伟大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where gardeners are held in high honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:59.20,3:29:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到了树林要走哪条路？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What road will you take once you reach the woods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:01.76,3:29:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,咕鲁说靠近米那斯魔窟…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gollum says there's a path...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:03.52,3:29:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,…有一条路会通到山上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}near Minas Morgul that climbs up into the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:07.88,3:29:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,西力斯昂哥？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cirith Ungol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:13.16,3:29:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是不是？ - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that its name? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:15.88,3:29:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:18.40,3:29:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以 - 佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Frodo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:21.76,3:29:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说米那斯魔窟上方有一个可怕的怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they say a dark terror dwells in the passes above Minas Morgul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:26.24,3:29:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不能走那条路 - 那是唯一的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You cannot go that way. - It is the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:29.08,3:29:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,主人说我们要去魔多，我们就要试试看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master says we must go to Mordor, so we must try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:36.88,3:29:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:42.24,3:29:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去吧，佛罗多，全人类都祝福你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Frodo. Go with the goodwill of all Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:45.96,3:29:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:59.80,3:30:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢让他们受伤害，你就不得好死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May death find you quickly if you bring them to harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:16.40,3:30:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，跟上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:21.40,3:30:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多不是故意要让那些人伤害你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo didn't mean for them Rangers to hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:24.84,3:30:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:27.44,3:30:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是想救你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was trying to save you, see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:29.56,3:30:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,救我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:31.44,3:30:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能怪他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there's no hard feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:33.76,3:30:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要原谅他 - 我不怪他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Forgive and forget. - No, no, no hard feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:39.04,3:30:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,咕鲁，咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gollum, Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:42.72,3:30:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是，主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:45.56,3:30:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好哈比人 - 你真好，{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice Hobbits. - Very decent of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:48.56,3:30:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是很好心，咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very decent, indeed, Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:56.36,3:31:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦在盛怒之下一定会报复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron's wrath will be terrible, his retribution swift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:08.72,3:31:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,圣盔谷之役结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The battle for Helm's Deep is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:12.36,3:31:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但是捍卫中土世界的圣战才刚开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The battle for Middle-earth is about to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:21.04,3:31:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人的希望都放在两个小哈比人身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All our hopes now lie with two little Hobbits...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:25.48,3:31:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在荒野游荡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somewhere in the wilderness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:32.04,3:31:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们会被编成故事或诗歌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if we'll ever be put into songs or tales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:35.56,3:31:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:37.12,3:31:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也许以后会有人说，咱们听听佛罗多和魔戒的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if people will ever say, "Let's hear about Frodo and the Ring."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:41.24,3:31:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个人就说，是啊，那是我最爱听的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they'll say, "Yes! That's one of my favorite stories."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:44.72,3:31:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多真的好勇敢哦，对不对，爸爸？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Frodo was really courageous, wasn't he, Dad?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:47.80,3:31:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Yes, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:49.64,3:31:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他是最有名的哈比人，真是了不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most famousest of Hobbits. And that's saying a lot."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:53.60,3:31:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了一个重要人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you've left out one of the chief characters:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:56.28,3:31:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,勇者山姆卫斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Samwise the Brave."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:31:58.40,3:32:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我想多听听山姆的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to hear more about Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:05.40,3:32:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多没有山姆就走不远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo wouldn't have got far without Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:09.72,3:32:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别笑我了，佛罗多，我是认真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Mr. Frodo, you shouldn't make fun. I was being serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:14.88,3:32:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So was I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:25.12,3:32:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,勇者山姆卫斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Samwise the Brave."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:32.08,3:32:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:33.60,3:32:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不等你哦，快来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going to wait for you. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:36.68,3:32:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:38.76,3:32:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,主人会照顾我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master looks after us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:42.52,3:32:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,主人不会伤害我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master wouldn't hurt us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:45.48,3:32:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,主人不守信用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master broke his promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:48.08,3:32:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别逼史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:50.44,3:32:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor, poor Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:53.80,3:32:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,主人出卖了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master betrayed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:56.80,3:32:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,奸诈狡猾、虚伪做作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wicked. Tricksy. False.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:00.12,3:33:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该把他的脖子扭断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ought to wring his filthy little neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:04.16,3:33:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him! Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:07.08,3:33:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them both!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:08.76,3:33:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们抢走宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we take the precious...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:12.56,3:33:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,自己做主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we be the master!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:16.76,3:33:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可是胖哈比人知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the fat Hobbit, he knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:19.60,3:33:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他老是盯着我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes always watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:22.44,3:33:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把他的眼睛戳瞎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we stabs them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:26.12,3:33:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把他的眼珠挖掉让他爬着走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put out his eyeses and make him crawl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:30.80,3:33:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好，好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:34.48,3:33:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:37.32,3:33:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好，不好！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:40.00,3:33:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,太冒险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too risky. It's too risky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:44.40,3:33:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪儿？他跑哪儿去了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he? Where has he gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:47.16,3:33:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咕鲁，你在哪儿？ - 史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Gollum! Where are you? - Smeagol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:49.96,3:33:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以让她下手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could let her do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:56.32,3:34:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，她可以下毒手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. She could do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:00.64,3:34:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，宝贝，她可以下手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, precious, she could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:05.36,3:34:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等他们死了我们就把它拿走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we takes it once they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:12.36,3:34:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要等他们死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:19.56,3:34:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，还有好长的路要走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Hobbits. Long ways to go yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:23.44,3:34:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈会带你们去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol will show you the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:25.68,3:34:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.{\r}
